{"type":"message","id":"b0f1afa4","parentId":"56fcfe8c","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:03:18.462Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-16 04:03:15 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b5131b6e440bcc3d1a5e2bbe8b27]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5131b6e440bcc3d1a5e2bbe8b27\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 04:03 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n我注册完成淘宝个人开发账号后,发现有很多现成的MCP:https://work.open.taobao.com/open-mcp-playground/McpSquare,请你帮忙认真检索一下,看看是不是可以立即提效"}],"timestamp":1776312198409}}
{"type":"message","id":"66a10117","parentId":"b0f1afa4","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:03:25.967Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户（晁留柱）说他已经注册好了淘宝个人开发账号，发现有现成的MCP（Model Context Protocol） playground在 https://work.open.taobao.com/open-mcp-playground/McpSquare，想让我帮他检索一下看看是否可以立即提效。\n\n我需要先读取相关的skill来了解如何处理这类请求。让我先看看有没有相关的skill。\n\n从可用的skills来看，有一个 miaoda-web-search 和 miaoda-web-fetch，可能用于搜索和获取网页内容。\n\n让我先抓取那个MCP playground页面，看看有什么现成的MCP可用。同时也可以搜索一下淘宝MCP的相关信息。\n\n让我先读取相关的skill文件，然后去网页上查看具体内容。"},{"type":"text","text":"我来帮你检索淘宝的MCP广场，看看有什么可以提效的工具！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o4wzopeq9teg_1","name":"web_crawl","arguments":{"url":"https://work.open.taobao.com/open-mcp-playground/McpSquare"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o4wzopeq9teg_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"淘宝开放平台 MCP Model Context Protocol 提效 工具"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776312198462,"responseId":"062f9286af9c9d5eedeb66c7b577450d"}}
