{"type":"message","id":"83936f3c","parentId":"598abfba","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:08:29.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Deploy the Taobao MCP integration immediately\n2. Create a Feishu card-style interactive prompt to guide users through the inquiry/price comparison process\n\nLet me first check the HEARTBEAT.md to understand the current project status, then work on this.\n\nThe user mentioned deploying the Taobao desktop client MCP and creating Feishu card-style interactions for inquiry/price comparison. Let me think about what needs to be done:\n\n1. For Taobao MCP deployment - I need to check if there's an OpenClaw skill for this (mcporter/taobao-native mentioned in the appinn article)\n2. Create a Feishu interactive card for guiding users through price inquiries\n\nLet me first check the workspace to understand what skills exist and what needs to be created."},{"type":"text","text":"明白！立即执行！先检查现有资源，然后完成部署。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cliqq6fb030h_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/workspace/agent/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-send-message/ 2>/dev/null && cat ~/workspace/agent/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-send-message/SKILL.md 2>/dev/null | head -100"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cliqq6fb030h_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find ~/workspace/agent -name \"*taobao*\" -o -name \"*mcporter*\" 2>/dev/null | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cliqq6fb030h_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776312498752,"responseId":"062f93b39c2a1cd441dddbccb138985f"}}
