{"type":"message","id":"74a80d7e","parentId":"f7b1fdcc","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:18:04.371Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is telling me that the URL for taobao-native MCP is `http://127.0.0.1:3654/mcp` (using 127.0.0.1 instead of localhost). This makes sense because localhost might resolve differently. I need to update the mcporter.json config to use 127.0.0.1 instead of localhost.\n\nAlso, this confirms that the user HAS installed the Taobao desktop client and has the MCP service running locally. So now I should:\n1. Update the mcporter.json to use 127.0.0.1\n2. Verify the connection is working"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！正在更新配置使用 `127.0.0.1`：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1343meyho10l_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/.openclaw/workspace/config/mcporter.json","content":"{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"taobao-native\": {\n      \"type\": \"streamableHttp\",\n      \"url\": \"http://127.0.0.1:3654/mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1343meyho10l_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && mcporter list taobao-native --config config/mcporter.json 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776313079212,"responseId":"062f95f72dae72830fb4854dc461e58a"}}
