{"type":"message","id":"3d7cc9fa","parentId":"8e5e9caa","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:18:17.324Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The connection is refused because the Taobao desktop client is not running on THIS machine (the sandbox/OpenClaw server). The Taobao desktop client needs to be installed on the user's local computer for the MCP to work.\n\nHowever, I notice this is running on a sandbox. The user needs to understand that:\n\n1. The OpenClaw is running on a server/sandbox (not on the user's local machine)\n2. The Taobao desktop client needs to be on the USER's local machine\n3. For the MCP to connect, either:\n   - The user needs to expose their local Taobao client to the internet (not recommended for security)\n   - Or the user needs to run OpenClaw locally on their machine\n\nLet me explain this to the user."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n配置已更新，但发现一个关键问题：\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 架构说明**\n\n| 组件 | 位置 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| OpenClaw（我） | 云端服务器 | ✅ 正常运行 |\n| 淘宝桌面客户端 | **您的本地电脑** | ❌ 需要安装 |\n\n**问题**：`127.0.0.1:3654` 是您本地电脑的地址，但我运行在云端服务器上，无法直接访问您家里的电脑。\n\n---\n\n**🔧 解决方案（二选一）**\n\n### 方案A：在本地电脑安装OpenClaw（推荐⭐⭐⭐）\n\n1. 在您的电脑上安装 OpenClaw（支持 Windows/Mac）\n2. 安装淘宝桌面客户端 v2.5.0\n3. 配置MCP连接\n4. 两者在同一台电脑上，完美打通！\n\n**优势**：淘宝客户端和OpenClaw同一台机器，MCP直接连通\n\n### 方案B：使用云端API做比价（无需安装）\n\n告诉我您要采购什么物资，我直接用**京东/淘宝开放平台API**帮您比价！\n\n- 京东API：个人账号即可申请\n- 淘宝API：已配置好（您刚发的配置）\n- Web搜索：立即可用\n\n---\n\n**💡 建议**\n\n如果想用淘宝桌面客户端的完整能力（包括旺旺聊天、自动下单），建议在本地电脑部署OpenClaw。\n\n如果只是做**采购比价**，直接告诉我物资清单，我用API帮您查！\n\n您想怎么推进？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776313085397,"responseId":"062f95fdeb01fc98860d7a138a3f2815"}}
