{"type":"message","id":"5fcb77d6","parentId":"aed99fbc","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:42:39.801Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the information I need. Let me create:\n\n1. A comprehensive SKILL for the JD procurement system with Feishu card output\n2. Check if there's an existing bitable for procurement prices to sync with\n\nKey findings:\n- 京东没有类似淘宝的桌面客户端MCP，但有JD API可以通过AppKey调用\n- 飞书多维表格API完整支持，需要创建采购价格记录表\n\nLet me create:\n1. Updated SKILL with proper Feishu card output format\n2. Check/create a bitable for price records\n3. Write a detailed guide"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4ia35dufatot_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app","arguments":{"action":"list"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776314554449,"responseId":"062f9bbabdaab4b4b5822dd6341a6e41"}}
