{"type":"message","id":"6b5ee5e7","parentId":"97754027","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:42:52.424Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我发现了一个现成的多维表格\"多AI协同知识共享池\"（ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd），我可以在那里创建\"德胧采购比价记录\"数据表。\n\n现在我需要：\n1. 创建采购比价数据表\n2. 更新SKILL加入多维表格导出功能\n3. 告诉晁总京东MCP情况\n\n关于京东MCP：\n- 京东有JoyAgent平台，但这是面向企业的智能体平台，不是类似淘宝taobao-native这样的轻量级桌面客户端\n- 京东开放平台有丰富的API，但需要AppKey调用\n- 淘宝有taobao-native这样的本地桌面客户端MCP，京东没有类似的\n\n所以答案是：京东没有类似淘宝taobao-native的MCP工具。但有完整的API可以通过Web调用。\n\n让我创建多维表格数据表。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qjytovzrhy8n_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table":{"fields":[{"field_name":"商品名称","type":1},{"field_name":"规格","type":1},{"field_name":"品类","type":3,"property":{"options":[{"name":"农产品"},{"name":"蔬菜"},{"name":"肉类"},{"name":"水产"},{"name":"禽蛋"},{"name":"调料"},{"name":"水果"},{"name":"工程材料"},{"name":"酒店用品"},{"name":"其他"}]}},{"field_name":"批发价(元/斤)","type":2},{"field_name":"淘宝价(元/斤)","type":2},{"field_name":"京东价(元/斤)","type":2},{"field_name":"拼多多价(元/斤)","type":2},{"field_name":"建议采购价(元/斤)","type":1},{"field_name":"风险提示","type":1},{"field_name":"查询时间","type":5},{"field_name":"数据来源","type":1},{"field_name":"查询用途","type":4,"property":{"options":[{"name":"核价"},{"name":"询价"},{"name":"比价"},{"name":"成本分析"},{"name":"供应商审核"}]}}],"name":"🦞 德胧采购比价记录"}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776314561467,"responseId":"062f9bc1a4216e506d329f0f983868c0"}}
