{"type":"message","id":"c309c322","parentId":"dc009296","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:03:51.469Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /home/gem/workspace/agent/media/inbound/989ca887-8027-4cf8-8d3b-d18b7306101c.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/gem/workspace/agent/media/inbound/989ca887-8027-4cf8-8d3b-d18b7306101c.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths - they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-04-16 05:03:48 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b513295fd00b0c2b732b3be41784, post, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b513295fd00b0c2b732b3be41784\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 05:03 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n/home/gem/workspace/agent/media/inbound/989ca887-8027-4cf8-8d3b-d18b7306101c.jpg\n另外,本地安装的淘宝的相关MCP在右上角的”设置“里面,有专门对接龙虾的配置选项. 最后,我们现在用的Web方式与本地部署在核心差异是什么? 如果我们兄弟酒店直接安装咱们整合后的SKILL,还要本地安装淘宝打开MCP么? 还有就是我们的酒店所处城市不同,不要直接把天津写死,就是复盘一下代码,减少死代码、硬编码,还要注意有些网站如果一旦没了、关停了,怎么能自动启用备用方案接替取价?"}],"timestamp":1776315831412}}
{"type":"message","id":"0db99e7e","parentId":"c309c322","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:03:56.024Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image and asks several questions:\n1. The local Taobao MCP configuration is in Settings, with a dedicated option to connect to OpenClaw\n2. What's the core difference between the Web method and local deployment?\n3. If brother hotels install the integrated SKILL, do they need to install Taobao MCP locally?\n4. Don't hardcode \"天津\" - review and refactor code\n5. If some websites go down, how to automatically use backup plans?\n\nLet me first look at the image to understand what it shows, then address all these questions."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e7cg1yq73xb2_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/media/inbound/989ca887-8027-4cf8-8d3b-d18b7306101c.jpg"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776315831469,"responseId":"062fa0b77dab1c6f6a98e8a940e715d0"}}
