{"type":"message","id":"9fd67766","parentId":"866882d4","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:05:46.477Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user asked about the key differences between Web version and local MCP version, whether brother hotels need to install anything, and asked me to refactor the code to remove hardcoded values and add automatic fallback mechanisms.\n\nI've completed all the tasks:\n1. Explained the core differences between Web and local MCP versions\n2. Clarified that brother hotels don't need to install anything if they just need price comparison\n3. Refactored the SKILL.md with no hardcoding and automatic fallback mechanisms\n4. Sent a summary card to the user\n\nThe user's question has been fully answered."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**✅ 完整复盘完成！**\n\n---\n\n**📋 核心结论**\n\n| 问题 | 答案 |\n|------|------|\n| Web版 vs 本地MCP核心差异？ | Web版无需安装但不能自动下单；本地MCP可自动下单/旺旺聊天 |\n| **兄弟酒店需要安装吗？** | **不需要！只做比价直接用Web版** |\n| 已完成哪些重构？ | 移除硬编码+城市无关+自动容灾+配置外部化 |\n\n---\n\n**🔧 重构亮点**\n\n1. **无硬编码** — 移除了\"天津\"等硬编码，城市从用户输入自动识别\n2. **自动容灾** — 主源失败自动切换fallback\n   ```\n   农业农村部 → 新发地 → 商务预报（自动接力）\n   淘宝 → 京东 → 拼多多（自动接力）\n   ```\n3. **配置外部化** — 数据源YAML配置，易增删\n\n---\n\n**🚀 兄弟酒店部署极简**\n\n现在只需要：把飞书机器人拉进群 → 兄弟们直接说「查xx价格」就能用！\n\n**无需安装任何东西** 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776315937947,"responseId":"062fa122524d5e5c39ca1b1062ea22c8"}}
