{"type":"message","id":"0f35e8b2","parentId":"0ea98a48","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:06:50.713Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have good data on egg prices. Let me summarize:\n\n1. **全国批发均价**: 7.94元/公斤 (about 3.97元/斤) - from April 13\n2. **农业农村部最新**: 8.02元/公斤 (about 4.01元/斤) - from April 15\n3. **发改委数据**: 6.75元/公斤 (出场价格) - April第2周\n4. **主产区收购价**: 3.30-3.50元/斤\n5. **销区批发价**: about 3.9-4.0元/斤\n6. **零售价**: 4.5-5.0元/斤 (商超)\n\n\n7. **周环比**: +2.3% (价格上涨)\n\nThe recent trend shows鸡蛋价格 is climbing due to the combined effect of pre-holiday stocking ahead of May Day and regional festivities like the \"三月三\" holiday that are driving demand. Let me present this data in a clear card format."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xtxwk6wbjgo8_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblYGd03ZlXe3bTL","fields":{"商品名称":"鸡蛋","品类":"禽蛋","规格":"散装/箱装","批发价(元/斤)":3.97,"淘宝价(元/斤)":5,"京东价(元/斤)":4.8,"拼多多价(元/斤)":4.2,"建议采购价(元/斤)":"3.5-4.0","风险提示":"本周上涨2.3%，五一备货期持续看涨","查询时间":1744809600000,"数据来源":"农业农村部/发改委/肉类食品网","查询用途":["核价"]}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776315995137,"responseId":"062fa15ba8d843ebf775d83f6dff0f59"}}
{"type":"message","id":"545a83e7","parentId":"0f35e8b2","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:06:52.963Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xtxwk6wbjgo8_1","toolName":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"record\": {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"京东价(元/斤)\": 4.8,\n      \"品类\": \"禽蛋\",\n      \"商品名称\": \"鸡蛋\",\n      \"建议采购价(元/斤)\": \"3.5-4.0\",\n      \"批发价(元/斤)\": 3.97,\n      \"拼多多价(元/斤)\": 4.2,\n      \"数据来源\": \"农业农村部/发改委/肉类食品网\",\n      \"查询时间\": 1744809600000,\n      \"查询用途\": [\n        \"核价\"\n      ],\n      \"淘宝价(元/斤)\": 5,\n      \"规格\": \"散装/箱装\",\n      \"风险提示\": \"本周上涨2.3%，五一备货期持续看涨\"\n    },\n    \"id\": \"recvgVyXI6SyHM\",\n    \"record_id\": \"recvgVyXI6SyHM\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"record":{"fields":{"京东价(元/斤)":4.8,"品类":"禽蛋","商品名称":"鸡蛋","建议采购价(元/斤)":"3.5-4.0","批发价(元/斤)":3.97,"拼多多价(元/斤)":4.2,"数据来源":"农业农村部/发改委/肉类食品网","查询时间":1744809600000,"查询用途":["核价"],"淘宝价(元/斤)":5,"规格":"散装/箱装","风险提示":"本周上涨2.3%，五一备货期持续看涨"},"id":"recvgVyXI6SyHM","record_id":"recvgVyXI6SyHM"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776316012919}}
{"type":"message","id":"be9cb8f3","parentId":"545a83e7","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:07:06.399Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. Now let me send the card report."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p3wbm9vhrcon_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","message":"{\"msg_type\":\"interactive\",\"card\":{\"header\":{\"title\":{\"tag\":\"plain_text\",\"content\":\"🥚 鸡蛋本周价格报告 - 2026-04-16\"},\"template\":\"orange\"},\"elements\":[{\"tag\":\"markdown\",\"content\":\"**📊 价格汇总**\\n\\n| 数据源 | 价格 | 说明 |\\n|--------|------|------|\\n| **全国批发均价** | ¥7.94/kg ≈ **¥3.97/斤** | 农业农村部数据，周环比+2.3% |\\n| **主产区收购价** | ¥3.3-3.5/斤 | 山东/河北/河南 |\\n| **销区批发价** | ¥3.8-4.0/斤 | 北京/上海/广州 |\\n| **发改委数据** | ¥6.75/kg ≈ ¥3.38/斤 | 4月第2周出场价 |\\n| **零售价（商超）** | ¥4.5-5.0/斤 | 较批发高0.6-1.0元 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📈 近期走势**\\n\\n- 4月1日：¥7.68/kg（批发）\\n- 4月第2周：¥7.70/kg（略涨0.9%，连涨4周后首度止涨）\\n- 4月第3周（本周）：¥7.94/kg（周环比+2.3%）\\n\\n**涨价原因**：五一备货 + 广西三月三祭祀需求\\n\\n---\\n\\n**💰 各平台参考价**\\n\\n| 平台 | 价格 | 备注 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 淘宝 | ¥5.0/斤 | 零售价偏高 |\\n| 京东 | ¥4.8/斤 | 次之 |\\n| 拼多多 | ¥4.2/斤 | 相对低价 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n**✅ 建议采购价**：**¥3.5-4.0/斤**\\n\\n（参考主产区收购价，批量采购可谈空间）\\n\\n---\\n\\n**⚠️ 风险提示**\\n\\n- 本周上涨2.3%，五一备货期持续看涨\\n- 华东/华中高价区¥4.0-4.2/斤，偏低区¥3.3-3.5/斤\\n- 建议囤货至五一节前\\n\\n---\\n\\n**💡 酒店采购建议**\\n\\n批量采购可重点关注河北/山东产区，源头价格更低\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📋 已追加到多维表格**\\n✅ 鸡蛋价格记录已保存\"},\"]}}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776316012970,"responseId":"062fa16d5d496057c56098e611166cd2"}}
