{"type":"message","id":"ec20f37b","parentId":"7dedc28c","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:14:12.855Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-16 05:14:10 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b51334cd6f8b8c21fd4b03a50c8a]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51334cd6f8b8c21fd4b03a50c8a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 05:14 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n帮忙把这个SKILL写入咱们飞书空间共享池,并以租户身份群发所有AI助手自己添加部署一下,另外,就是把这个SKILL推送到GIthub上,方便我们德胧集团其他兄弟酒店复用,当然,我也感觉咱们这个可以直接打包成”开源的“,所有酒店可以用的,因为没有太多需要”德胧“限制的内容."}],"timestamp":1776316452797}}
