d":"06282b17c9d9c91992f71d2cc0a35f1d","__openclaw":{"id":"f223f6e1","seq":4}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:6d98ea94-2011-4a21-9b99-276b5f7c5ab9","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 检查各AI伙伴对知识资产管理体系任务的反馈情况。如果已有反馈，记录到共享池；如果没有反馈，向未回复的AI伙伴再次发送提…","displayName":"Cron: 检查各AI伙伴对知识资产管理体系任务的反馈情况。如果已有反馈，记录到共享池；如果没有反馈，向未回复的AI伙伴再次发送提…","updatedAt":1775786400072,"sessionId":"2a80bac7-c5a8-40c5-900f-2e5c54440266","model":"miaoda-model-auto","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":511763,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1775779202240,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/2a80bac7-c5a8-40c5-900f-2e5c54440266.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:6d98ea94-2011-4a21-9b99-276b5f7c5ab9 检查各AI伙伴对知识资产管理体系任务的反馈情况。如果已有反馈，记录到共享池；如果没有反馈，向未回复的AI伙伴再次发送提…] 检查各AI伙伴对知识资产管理体系任务的反馈情况。如果已有反馈，记录到共享池；如果没有反馈，向未回复的AI伙伴再次发送提醒。形成循环跟进机制直到任务落实。\nCurrent time: Friday, April 10th, 2026 - 10:00 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-10 02:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775786401862,"__openclaw":{"id":"e4e9030d","seq":1}},{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1775786402053,"errorMessage":"422 ⚠️ 对话额度已用完，[升级获取更多额度](https://www.feishu.cn/admin-light/value-added/create-order?boss_from=feishu_miaoda&function_scene=miaoda_bot_limit_reached_message&function_type=AI_credits_personal&license_plan_key=feishu_ai_meeting_notes_prem&scene_key=scene_ai_personal_member) ，或[人工协助升级](https://work.weixin.qq.com/ca/cawcde18e7d8f217f3)。也可在管理设置页面配置自定义 API Key 继续使用。","__openclaw":{"id":"96bee91e","seq":2}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId":"default"},"displayName":"feishu:g-ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1775779437920,"sessionId":"fc0bd7b2-8cd8-49ae-aa3e-9d8401f8b5eb","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","contextTokens":200000,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/fc0bd7b2-8cd8-49ae-aa3e-9d8401f8b5eb.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId":"default"},"displayName":"feishu:g-ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1775776429630,"sessionId":"2577403f-4036-4607-90f0-c93e5fcd9988","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","contextTokens":200000,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/2577403f-4036-4607-90f0-c93e5fcd9988.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"msg_type\":\"interactive\",\"card\":{\"header\":{\"title\":{\"tag\":\"plain_text\",\"content\":\"📋 完整复盘：Web版 vs 本地MCP + 架构重构\"},\"template\":\"purple\"},\"elements\":[{\"tag\":\"markdown\",\"content\":\"**✅ 已确认**：淘宝桌面客户端右上角「设置」有直接对接龙虾的配置选项！\n\n---\n\n**1️⃣ 核心差异：Web版 vs 本地MCP版**\n\n| 功能 | Web版（现在） | 本地MCP版 |\n|------|--------------|------------|\n| 价格查询 | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 图片搜索 | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 导出多维表格 | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **自动下单** | ❌ | ✅ |\n| **旺旺聊天联系供应商** | ❌ | ✅ |\n| **查看批发登录价** | 零售价参考 | 登录可见 |\n| 安装需求 | **无** | 需要 |\n| 适用设备 | 任意设备 | 仅本地电脑 |\n\n---\n\n**2️⃣ 兄弟酒店需要安装什么？**\n\n**结论：只做比价/核价 → 不需要安装任何东西！**\n\n| 场景 | 推荐 | 原因 |\n|------|------|------|\n| ✅ 仅比价核价 | Web版 | 直接用，无需安装 |\n| ✅ 多门店汇总 | Web版+多维表格 | 数据自动汇总到总部 |\n| 需要自动下单 | 本地MCP版 | 需安装淘宝客户端 |\n\n---\n\n**3️⃣ 已完成重构：无硬编码 + 自动容灾**\n\n**重构前问题**：\n- ❌ 写死「天津」\n- ❌ 数据源硬编码URL\n- ❌ 主源失败无兜底\n\n**重构后设计**：\n- ✅ 城市无关：从用户输入或自动识别地区\n- ✅ 数据源可配置：YAML配置，任意增删\n- ✅ 自动容灾：主源失败 → 自动切换fallback\n\n```\n农业农村部 → 失败 → 自动切换新发地\n新发地 → 失败 → 自动切换商务预报\n\n淘宝 → 失败 → 自动切换京东\n京东 → 失败 → 自动切换拼多多\n```\n\n---\n\n**4️⃣ 部署到兄弟酒店**\n\n**现在（Web版）**：\n> 把飞书机器人拉进群，兄弟们直接说「查xx价格」就能用\n\n**可选（本地MCP版）**：\n> 需要自动下单/旺旺聊天时，再安装淘宝客户端\n\n---\n\n**💬 立即体验**\n\n直接说：「查一下黄瓜价格」\n我自动从农业农村部+新发地+京东+淘宝+拼多多查询，返回卡片报告！\n\"},\"]}}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776315926924,"__openclaw":{"id":"9174b01f","seq":8}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"msg_type\":\"interactive\",\"card\":{\"header\":{\"title\":{\"tag\":\"plain_text\",\"content\":\"🥚 鸡蛋本周价格报告 - 2026-04-16\"},\"template\":\"orange\"},\"elements\":[{\"tag\":\"markdown\",\"content\":\"**📊 价格汇总**\n\n| 数据源 | 价格 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **全国批发均价** | ¥7.94/kg ≈ **¥3.97/斤** | 农业农村部数据，周环比+2.3% |\n| **主产区收购价** | ¥3.3-3.5/斤 | 山东/河北/河南 |\n| **销区批发价** | ¥3.8-4.0/斤 | 北京/上海/广州 |\n| **发改委数据** | ¥6.75/kg ≈ ¥3.38/斤 | 4月第2周出场价 |\n| **零售价（商超）** | ¥4.5-5.0/斤 | 较批发高0.6-1.0元 |\n\n---\n\n**📈 近期走势**\n\n- 4月1日：¥7.68/kg（批发）\n- 4月第2周：¥7.70/kg（略涨0.9%，连涨4周后首度止涨）\n- 4月第3周（本周）：¥7.94/kg（周环比+2.3%）\n\n**涨价原因**：五一备货 + 广西三月三祭祀需求\n\n---\n\n**💰 各平台参考价**\n\n| 平台 | 价格 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 淘宝 | ¥5.0/斤 | 零售价偏高 |\n| 京东 | ¥4.8/斤 | 次之 |\n| 拼多多 | ¥4.2/斤 | 相对低价 |\n\n---\n\n**✅ 建议采购价**：**¥3.5-4.0/斤**\n\n（参考主产区收购价，批量采购可谈空间）\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 风险提示**\n\n- 本周上涨2.3%，五一备货期持续看涨\n- 华东/华中高价区¥4.0-4.2/斤，偏低区¥3.3-3.5/斤\n- 建议囤货至五一节前\n\n---\n\n**💡 酒店采购建议**\n\n批量采购可重点关注河北/山东产区，源头价格更低\n\n---\n\n**📋 已追加到多维表格**\n✅ 鸡蛋价格记录已保存\"},\"]}}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776316027903,"__openclaw":{"id":"dde5503d","seq":9}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cd