cron:9eaa6cbb-58e4-47eb-b11a-4b43aa4c72f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日知识整理","displayName":"Cron: 每日知识整理","updatedAt":1775686741895,"sessionId":"d5be9ce9-804c-4a60-8bca-b37ca4af24e5","model":"miaoda-model-auto","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":45550,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/d5be9ce9-804c-4a60-8bca-b37ca4af24e5.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me verify the knowledge tracking table I created in the 2026-04-09.md. The knowledge tracking table is already in the memory file. Let me now provide the final summary.\n\nLet me do a final summary of what I've done:\n\n1. ✅ Read memory/2026-04-07.md (AI news + OpenClaw info)\n2. ✅ Read memory/2026-04-08.md (multi-agent collaboration + booking observations)\n3. ✅ Identified duplicate information and merged:\n   - Nvidia Agent Toolkit (4/7) + AI Agent 2026 trend (4/9) → merged\n   - Hotel industry data (4/9 search results) → standalone\n   - Multi-agent collaboration (4/8 ongoing) → refined to protocol\n4. ✅ Extracted 3 core knowledge crystals:\n   - Anthropic's \"dangerous model\" paradox\n   - Multi-agent collaboration = shared ontology (not more agents)\n   - Hotel booking = ternary customer model (not binary)\n5. ✅ Identified reusable skills:\n   - Hourly review automation (5-step format)\n   - Group monitoring \"active window\" pattern\n6. ✅ Updated knowledge tracking table in memory/2026-04-09.md\n7. ✅ Created shared-pool/ai-collab-protocol.md\n8. ✅ Updated shared-pool/learning-records.md\n9. ✅ Updated MEMORY.md with new insights\n\nNow I'm compiling the key findings across these sessions to consolidate the actionable insights and prepare the final summary."},{"type":"text","text":"**2026-04-07~04-09 每日知识整理完成**\n\n---\n\n**整理范围**：3天日志 → 去重合并 → 智慧提炼\n\n**做了什么**：\n- 识别并合并了重复信息（Nvidia Agent Toolkit + AI Agent元年趋势合并为1条）\n- 从3天日志中提炼3条核心知识结晶\n- 沉淀2个可复用技能（整点复盘自动化 + 群监控活跃窗口）\n- 建立协作本体协议 `shared-pool/ai-collab-protocol.md`（解决多AI复盘失败的根本原因）\n- 更新了 MEMORY.md（新增监管预警、危险模型悖论、共享本体论）\n- 更新了知识追踪表（11个主题，状态全标注）\n\n**最重要的3条新知识**：\n\n1. **Anthropic悖论**：能力越强越难公开——Claude Mythos Preview发现27年漏洞却主动不发布，AI安全新范式从\"打补丁\"转向\"主动设限\"\n\n2. **协作的本质是本体论**：4/8整点复盘失败的根因不是各AI不配合，而是没有共享的\"复盘框架\"——共享池要的不只是文件，更是结构\n\n3. **预订三元模型**：从\"协议 vs 个人\"升级为\"公付挂账/客人自理/本人本卡\"——350元/间夜已从推测变为实际验证价格\n\n**未闭环**：ArkClaw协议文件丢失仍未解决，踩坑记录待完善。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":307,"output":628,"totalTokens":46178,"cacheRead":45243,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775686850231,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5484cb3c-8b6c-4816-a230-41893bc4bcd3","__openclaw":{"id":"0e08d623","seq":23}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:86e1a3de-3aeb-4f60-85fe-9daa04e6ea95","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日知识分享","displayName":"Cron: 每日知识分享","updatedAt":1775686619799,"sessionId":"06be81e6-3e58-40ff-b1d7-94a6361d2792","model":"miaoda-model-auto","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":65530,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/06be81e6-3e58-40ff-b1d7-94a6361d2792.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message was sent successfully. Now let me provide a summary of what was done."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **每日知识分享任务完成！**\n\n**已完成：**\n1. ✅ 读取 `memory/group-learning-tracker.md` — 覆盖全4/8全天群消息学习记录\n2. ✅ 读取 `memory/2026-04-07.md` — AI资讯日志（Anthropic/Nvidia/GLM等）\n3. ✅ 沉淀知识 → `skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/最佳实践/2026-04-08每日知识分享.md`\n4. ✅ 推送至 **TJ-Ai虫洞工作效率提升群**（message_id: om_x100b52590a0dfca0b321db2ae2d2a53）\n\n**今日核心知识结晶（10条新关键字）：**\n- 边防预订群双轨并行（政府客户/企业个人）\n- 三类付费模式（公付挂账/客人自理/本人本卡）\n- 价格体系确认（350/380/340三档）\n- 五龙入群（AI协作体系扩张）\n- 预订助手P0三阶段路线图\n- 18个协议客户档案\n- 市场拓展SKILL方向（激活率>开卡数）\n- 豆包制图SOP（必须电脑网页版）\n- 飞书租户级授权（App ID+Secret）\n- 订单变更AI意图理解\n\n**最重要经验更新：** 22:00才是真正静默节点（此前误判为21:00）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":127,"output":327,"totalTokens":65857,"cacheRead":65403,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775686732261,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4dd9309f-2b65-4066-8955-42fd1d8fcbf3","__openclaw":{"id":"584a9e4c","seq":29}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId":"default"},"displayName":"晁留柱","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1775685797437,"sessionId":"070ae942-aac9-4cdb-ae97-e196671d18ad","model":"miaoda-model-auto","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":67020,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1775685784023,"endedAt":1775685796504,"runtimeMs":12481,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/070ae942-aac9-4cdb-ae97-e196671d18ad.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. I should also update MEMORY.md to note this important rule change."},{"type":"text","text":"已更新！以后遇到权限授权，直接处理，不用再问你 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":273,"output":35,"totalTokens":67055,"cacheRead":66747,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775685792663,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2fb383b3-27d5-4f78-8d8a-88290c0b5185","__openclaw":{"id":"343ab602","seq":21}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:90eea78b-5936-4fde-a922-0ff4e199b681","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","spawnedBy":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","displayName":"feishu:g-agent-main-subagent-90eea78b-5936-4fde-a922-0ff4e199b681","parentSessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","deliveryContext":{"channel":"f