/main/sessions/1f9e1469-9342-4367-b67b-1ac9dfbd5dd9.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1776303259519,\n      \"sessionId\": \"67cf2893-de3e-477f-b538-a7b8d8e4b0aa\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/67cf2893-de3e-477f-b538-a7b8d8e4b0aa.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\",\n        \"threadId\": \"omt_1abadc11228f9bb8\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1776294566577,\n      \"sessionId\": \"7812a8f5-a163-4af1-8719-ef6b3e43bc0c\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1776294541311,\n      \"endedAt\": 1776294565634,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 24323,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"chat:oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"default\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/7812a8f5-a163-4af1-8719-ef6b3e43bc0c.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"Good, I can access the bitable fine. The issue is that other AI bots (like the bot that reported the error) might not have access. Let me check if there are records in the tables. Actually, the issue is about permissions - the error code 1310214 is a Feishu Bitable permission error.\\n\\nActually, looking at this more carefully - the question is whether the *other* AI bots have access to this bitable. Since I'm a bot running in this conversation, I can access it. But other bots might not.\\n\\nThe user (晁留柱) is asking me (@workbuddy) to give all AI partners admin permissions. The bot ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0 is workbuddy. \\n\\n\\nSo the user is telling workbuddy to grant management permissions to all AI partners. But I'm Arkclaw, not workbuddy - I can't actually modify another bot's permissions. The real question is whether the user wants me to help them do this, or if they're confused about which bot is which.\\n\\nLooking at the flow: workbuddy created a shared knowledge pool bitable and encountered a permission error, so the user is asking me to grant access to all AI partners. The limitation here is that in Feishu, you can't directly grant permissions to bots - you'd need to invite them to the bitable as members through the Feishu interface itself. Let me respond with what's actually feasible given these constraints.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"多维表格可以正常访问，四张核心表都在 ✅\\n\\n但关于「给所有AI伙伴开通管理权限」，需要跟你说明一个现实情况 🦞\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📋 权限说明\\n\\n**飞书多维表格的权限机制**：\\n\\n| 操作 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| ✅ 我现在能做的事 | 读写这个多维表格（因为已获得授权） |\\n| ❌ 不能做的事 | 代表其他AI机器人授权访问（飞书限制） |\\n\\n**原因**：每个飞书应用机器人是独立的「身份」，要给它们开权限，需要：\\n\\n```\\n方案1：在飞书多维表格界面手动添加\\n  → 打开多维表格 → 右上角「分享」→ 添加「workbuddy」「Hermes」等机器人\\n\\n方案2：由各AI机器人自己申请授权\\n  → 机器人访问多维表格链接 → 用户点击授权 → 机器人获得权限\\n\\n方案3：开通「所有成员可读」权限\\n  → 多维表格设置 → 分享范围 → 「组织内所有人」或「指定人」\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ⚡ 立即可以做的事\\n\\n你作为多维表格所有者，可以：\\n\\n1. **打开这个多维表格**：`https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd`\\n2. 点击右上角「分享」\\n3. 搜索并添加以下机器人为「可管理」：\\n   - `workbuddy应用机器人`\\n   - `Hermes`\\n   - `QclawAI助手`\\n   - `Arkclaw`（我）\\n\\n---\\n\\n**或者更简单**：把多维表格的分享范围设置为「组织内所有成员可编辑」，一劳永逸。\\n\\n你希望用哪种方式？我可以帮你截图指引 🦞\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-token-plan\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 0,\n            \"output\": 0,\n            \"totalTokens\": 0,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1776294550229,\n          \"responseId\": \"062f4d9607406b1072efef7f6116286e\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"7bb66a46\",\n            \"seq\": 58\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:subagent:2c709ff6-3acf-4d7a-b8ea-a32c3ba6f5a8\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"spawnedBy\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"label\": \"1688-api\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-agent-main-subagent-2c709ff6-3acf-4d7a-b8ea-a32c3ba6f5a8\",\n      \"parentSessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1776244600017,\n      \"sessionId\": \"c702796b-3550-40d8-b931-41e0dfbc1350\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1776244038386,\n      \"endedAt\": 1776244566355,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 518039,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      