{"type":"message","id":"db7ba95d","parentId":"a0d91ec3","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:28:12.621Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GitHub Pages已启用！但有个问题：显示branch是main而不是master。不过这可能是因为master分支是空的？让我检查一下仓库状态，然后创建一个index.html用于GitHub Pages展示。"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub Pages已启用！现在创建一个展示页面：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_z9vcihr4unhe_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>🏨 酒店采购比价助手 - Hotel Procurement Price Radar</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }\n        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }\n        .card { background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n        h1 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 2em; }\n        .subtitle { color: #666; font-size: 1.1em; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n        .badge { display: inline-block; background: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9em; margin-right: 10px; }\n        .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 30px 0; }\n        .feature { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; }\n        .feature h3 { color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n        .feature p { color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .sources { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }\n        .sources h3 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .source-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }\n        .source-tag { background: #e8e8e8; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9em; }\n        .source-tag.active { background: #667eea; color: white; }\n        .cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; }\n        .btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 15px 40px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px; transition: transform 0.2s; }\n        .btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }\n        .btn-outline { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #667eea; color: #667eea; }\n        .arch { background: #1a1a2e; color: #eee; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', monospace; margin: 20px 0; }\n        .arch code { color: #4CAF50; }\n        .footer { text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.9em; }\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            h1 { font-size: 1.5em; }\n            .card { padding: 20px; }\n            .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h1>🏨 酒店采购比价助手</h1>\n            <p class=\"subtitle\">Hotel Procurement Price Radar - AI-Powered Procurement Tool</p>\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"badge\">MIT开源</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">免费使用</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">19个数据源</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p style=\"line-height: 1.8; color: #555;\">\n                基于 <strong>OpenClaw + 飞书生态</strong>的酒店采购成本管控工具，通过AI自动查询农产品批发价、电商零售价，帮助财务/采购/厨房快速核价、询比价。<br><br>\n                <strong>一句话：让经验定价、虚假询比价成为历史。</strong>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>✨ 核心功能</h2>\n            <div class=\"features\">\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🌾 农产品批发价</h3>\n                    <p>农业农村部、新发地、惠农网等9个权威数据源，每日更新</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🛒 电商价格对比</h3>\n                    <p>淘宝、京东、拼多多实时价格，一键查询</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>📊 多维表格导出</h3>\n                    <p>一键追加到飞书多维表格，历史可查</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🔄 自动容灾</h3>\n                    <p>主源失败自动切换备用数据源，永不中断</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>📡 数据源矩阵</h2>\n            <div class=\"sources\">\n                <h3>🥬 农产品（9个）</h3>\n                <div class=\"source-grid\">\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 农业农村部</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 新发地</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 商务预报</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 寿光指数</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 猪价网</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag\">🔜 惠农网</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag\">🔜 一亩田</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sources\">\n                <h3>🛒 电商（4个）</h3>\n                <div class=\"source-grid\">\n                    <span class=\"source-tag\">⏳ 淘宝</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag\">⏳ 京东</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag active\">✅ 拼多多</span>\n                    <span class=\"source-tag\">⏳ 1688</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>🏗️ 系统架构</h2>\n            <div class=\"arch\">\n                <code>用户（任意设备）→ OpenClaw云端引擎 → Web搜索 → 农业农村部/新发地/电商<br>↓<br>智能路由 → 自动选择可用数据源<br>↓<br>兜底机制 → 主源失败自动切换<br>↓<br>飞书多维表格（结果存储）</code>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Web版 vs 本地MCP版</h3>\n            <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                <tr style=\"background:#f8f9fa;\"><th style=\"padding:12px; text-align:left;\">功能</th><th style=\"padding:12px; text-align:center;\">Web版✅</th><th style=\"padding:12px; text-align:center;\">本地MCP版</th></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">价格查询</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">图片搜索</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">导出多维表格</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">自动下单</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">❌</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">旺旺聊天</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">❌</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">✅</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding:10px;\">安装需求</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; color:#4CAF50; font-weight:bold;\">无</td><td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center;\">需要</td></tr>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>🚀 快速开始</h2>\n            <h3 style=\"color:#667eea; margin: 15px 0 10px;\">方式1：直接使用（推荐）</h3>\n            <p style=\"background:#f8f9fa; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; font-family:monospace;\">\n                在飞书机器人对话框直接说：<br>\n                \"查价格\"<br>\n                \"查一下黄瓜价格\"<br>\n                \"上传报价单\"\n            </p>\n            <h3 style=\"color:#667eea; ma