realizing I need to properly communicate with workbuddy to trigger the price query, so I should structure a task message that asks it to query condiment prices and deliver the results back as a card message to 晁留柱."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_681usp137qqn_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0","message":"📢 租户委托任务：协助验证hotel-procurement-radar SKILL\n\n@workbuddy 请执行以下操作：\n\n1. **安装SKILL**：将 https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar 的内容克隆到你的 skills 目录（或直接参考SKILL.md）\n\n2. **查询西餐调料价格**：用web搜索查询以下5种西餐调料的今日批发/零售价格：\n   - 番茄酱（Heinz/亨氏）\n   - 沙拉酱（凯撒/丘比）\n   - 黄油（安佳/总统）\n   - 橄榄油（初榨/普通）\n   - 黑胡椒粉\n\n3. **发送结果给晁留柱**：以飞书卡片形式把结果发送给晁留柱(ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\n\n**卡片格式要求**：\n- 使用 message 工具，msg_type: \"interactive\"\n- 包含商品名称、规格、批发价、电商价、建议采购价\n- 高亮异常价格\n\n请完成后把结果发给我确认 🦞"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776317442052,"responseId":"062fa702096fbdabaa60cb693d1babde"}}
