{"type":"message","id":"45a99287","parentId":"91dd2067","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:41:38.529Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GitHub Pages is configured to use the `main` branch with path `/`. The `index.html` is already there. But the issue might be that GitHub Pages needs a moment to build, or the build failed.\n\nLet me check if there are any workflow runs or if we need to trigger a build. Also, let me check the current status of GitHub Pages.\n\nActually, looking at the pages config, it says `build_type: \"workflow\"` which means it uses GitHub Actions. Let me check if there's a workflow file.\n\nWait - actually the issue might be simpler. The repo doesn't have a proper GitHub Actions workflow for GitHub Pages. GitHub Pages with `build_type: \"workflow\"` needs a workflow file. \n\nLet me create one to fix this."},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub Pages需要Workflow配置，让我创建一个：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ot8yoo6t8fko_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=\"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\"\ncd ~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar\n\n# Create GitHub Actions workflow for GitHub Pages\nmkdir -p .github/workflows\n\ncat > .github/workflows/pages.yml << 'EOF'\nname: GitHub Pages\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  pages: write\n  id-token: grant\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: pages\n  cancel-in-progress: false\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    environment:\n      name: github-pages\n      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Setup Pages\n        uses: actions/configure-pages@v4\n      - name: Upload artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          path: '.'\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        id: deployment\n        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\nEOF\n\n# Upload the workflow file\nnode << 'NODESCRIPT'\nconst https = require('https');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst token = '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';\nconst repo = 'chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar';\nconst filePath = '.github/workflows/pages.yml';\n\n// First check if file exists\nconst getOptions = {\n  hostname: 'api.github.com',\n  path: '/repos/' + repo + '/contents/' + filePath,\n  method: 'GET',\n  headers: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token, 'User-Agent': 'node.js' }\n};\n\nhttps.get(getOptions, (res) => {\n  let body = '';\n  res.on('data', c => body += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    let sha = null;\n    try { sha = JSON.parse(body).sha; } catch(e) {}\n    \n    const content = fs.readFileSync(filePath, 'utf8');\n    const encoded = Buffer.from(content).toString('base64');\n    \n    const postData = JSON.stringify({\n      message: 'Add GitHub Pages workflow',\n      content: encoded,\n      sha: sha\n    });\n    \n    const putOptions = {\n      hostname: 'api.github.com',\n      path: '/repos/' + repo + '/contents/' + filePath,\n      method: 'PUT',\n      headers: {\n        'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token,\n        'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        'User-Agent': 'hotel-procurement-radar',\n        'Content-Length': Buffer.byteLength(postData)\n      }\n    };\n    \n    const req = https.request(putOptions, (res2) => {\n      let body2 = '';\n      res2.on('data', c => body2 += c);\n      res2.on('end', () => {\n        try {\n          const r = JSON.parse(body2);\n          console.log(r.content ? 'OK: workflow created' : 'FAIL: ' + (r.message || 'unknown'));\n        } catch(e) { console.log('FAIL: parse error'); }\n      });\n    });\n    req.on('error', e => console.log('FAIL: ' + e.message));\n    req.write(postData);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}).on('error', e => console.log('FAIL get: ' + e.message));\nNODESCRIPT"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776318083235,"responseId":"062fa983dd8f944d0f2e9045b3733a06"}}
