{"type":"message","id":"051d5f0e","parentId":"e5c888e1","timestamp":"2026-04-16T05:42:07.464Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Network issue. Let me try again with a simpler approach - just create an index.html that GitHub Pages can serve directly from the root."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2ffr1judw9r2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=\"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\"\ncd ~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar\n\n# Create a proper index.html for GitHub Pages\ncat > index.html << 'EOF'\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>🏨 酒店采购比价助手 - Hotel Procurement Radar</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { \n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 40px 20px;\n        }\n        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }\n        .card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 40px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        h1 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 2.2em; }\n        .subtitle { color: #666; font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n        .badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #10b981;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 6px 16px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n        .feature {\n            background: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;\n        }\n        .feature h3 { color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n        .feature p { color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .cta {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n        .cta a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 16px 40px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            transition: transform 0.2s;\n        }\n        .cta a:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }\n        .datasources { margin-top: 30px; }\n        .datasource-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        .datasource {\n            background: #f1f5f9;\n            padding: 12px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            color: #475569;\n        }\n        .datasource::before { content: '✅ '; }\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        footer a { color: white; }\n        .arch {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', monospace;\n            font-size: 0.85em;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            overflow-x: auto;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n        .arch .key { color: #fbbf24; }\n        .arch .val { color: #34d399; }\n        .arch .arrow { color: #f472b6; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <span class=\"badge\">🚀 开源免费</span>\n            <h1>🏨 酒店采购比价助手</h1>\n            <p class=\"subtitle\">Hotel Procurement Price Radar</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"features\">\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🌾 农产品批发价</h3>\n                    <p>农业农村部、新发地、惠农网等9个数据源，实时查询全国批发均价</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🛒 电商价格对比</h3>\n                    <p>淘宝、京东、拼多多、1688四平台价格实时对比</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>📸 图片搜索</h3>\n                    <p>发送商品图片，AI自动识别并搜索同款比价</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>📋 多维表格导出</h3>\n                    <p>一键追加到飞书多维表格，自动创建无需配置</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🔄 自动容灾</h3>\n                    <p>主源失败自动切换备用数据源，永不掉线</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🏨 全品类覆盖</h3>\n                    <p>蔬菜/肉类/水产/调料/禽蛋/水果/工程材料/酒店用品</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"cta\">\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar\">📦 查看 GitHub 源码</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>🏗️ 系统架构</h2>\n            <div class=\"arch\">\n<span class=\"key\">用户</span>（任意城市/设备）<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n<span class=\"key\">OpenClaw</span>（云端引擎）<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n<span class=\"key\">Web搜索</span>（19个数据源）<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n<span class=\"key\">智能路由</span>（自动容灾）<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n<span class=\"val\">飞书多维表格</span>\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95em;\">\n                <strong>Web版</strong>：无需安装，任意设备可用 | <strong>本地MCP版</strong>：可自动下单+旺旺聊天\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>📡 数据源矩阵（19个）</h2>\n            <div class=\"datasources\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #333; margin-bottom: 5px;\">🌾 农产品（9个）</h3>\n                <div class=\"datasource-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">农业农村部 - 官方批发价</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">北京新发地 - 批发市场</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">惠农网 - 产地价/实时</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">一亩田 - 批发市场</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">商务预报 - 全国均价</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">寿光蔬菜指数 - 山东基准</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">猪价网 - 猪肉/仔猪</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"datasources\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #333; margin-bottom: 5px;\">🛒 电商（4个）</h3>\n                <div class=\"datasource-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">淘宝/天猫 - 零售/批发价</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">京东 - 零售/企业采购</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">拼多多 - 百亿补贴</div>\n                    <div class=\"datasource\">1688 - 批发价</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2>🚀 快速开始</h2>\n            <p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                <strong>方式1：</strong>直接对飞书机器人说「查价格」或「查xx价格」<br>\n                <strong>方式2：</strong>克隆到本地 OpenClaw<br>\n                <code style=\"background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em;\">\n                    git clone https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar.git\n                </code>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <footer>\n            <p>🏨 酒店采购比价助手 | <a href=\"https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar\">GitHub</a> | MIT License</p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">维护者：德胧AI龙虾军团</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\n\necho \"index.html created ($(wc -c < index.html) bytes)\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776318098747,"responseId":"062fa992e6c0dfe0a6db48f497849e0f"}}
