{"type":"message","id":"e9e965da","parentId":"3ee7829f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T07:40:12.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a pre-compaction memory flush. I need to store durable memories in memory/2026-04-16.md. Let me check what's been happening and append new content.The conversation shows:\n1. User (晁留柱) was testing the SKILL and asked about 三黄鸡 (三黄鸡) prices in Ningbo\n2. The output format was criticized as \"乱糟糟\" (messy)\n3. Multiple iterations of SKILL updates (v5.0 → v6.0 → v6.1)\n4. The user showed an example of a good format (房间检查报告格式)\n5. The format uses standard markdown tables (not code blocks), `##` headers, `---` dividers\n\n\n6. I've been updating the skill throughout this session but haven't yet pushed the improvements to GitHub\n\nNow I need to add a new entry to memory/2026-04-16.md capturing the latest iteration on SKILL format standards."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zev9zb788noz_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md","content":"\n\n\n## 07:39 - SKILL v6.x 卡片格式迭代（最终标准）\n\n### 迭代记录\n- v5.0: 强制卡片输出规范\n- v6.0: 流式进度卡片 + 四步曲\n- v6.1: 完整表格保留 + 价格排名\n- **v6.2: 采用标准markdown表格格式（非代码块）**\n\n### 晁总确认的最终格式标准\n\n**✅ 标准markdown表格**（无```代码块）\n```\n| 排名 | 规格 | 价格 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 🥇 | xxx | ¥4.00/斤 | xxx |\n```\n\n**✅ `##` 大标题分区**\n```\n## 📍 宁波地区批发价\n## 📍 全国批发均价\n```\n\n**✅ `---` 分隔线区分大区块**\n\n**✅ 状态emoji清晰**\n```\n✅ 合格 | ⏳ 待执行 | ❌ 不合格\n```\n\n### GitHub推送状态\n- ⚠️ GitHub API网络问题仍未解决\n- 本地已是最新版本（v6.2）\n- 需要手动推送或等网络恢复\n\n### 定时任务状态\n- 1688 API申请：⏳ 等待晁总注册1688账号\n- 京东API申请：⏳ 等待晁总注册京东开发者账号（使用13820945137）\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776325196280,"responseId":"062fc54c881079ac420b5