dn't match exactly\n   - Second edit attempt also failed\n   - Read the file to see current contents\n   - Planned to rewrite the whole SKILL.md with v6.1 updates\n\nKey identifiers:\n- msg_id: om_x100b51338a67eca4b345405225035cb\n- sender_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\n- replied_to: om_x100b5133f13120acc45eb5d4f5594a9\n- messageId: om_x100b513386a044acc2eebbc01336181\n- chatId: oc_2dc8a473be229282cffd2b87460dc8a8\n- skill path: /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md\n\nThe card was successfully sent to the user. The SKILL.md update was blocked by edit failures.\n</think>\n\n## Decisions\n- **Keep full tables**: User explicitly requested NOT to simplify tables because complexity demonstrates work quality\n- **Add ranking/highlighting**: Instead of simplification, add price ranking with medals (🥇🥈🥉) and bold key prices\n- **Update SKILL.md to v6.1**: Update the result card template to reflect the new design principle\n\n## Open TODOs\n- [ ] Successfully update SKILL.md with v6.1 changes (previous edit attempts failed due to text mismatch)\n- [ ] Rewrite the full SKILL.md file with updated result card template\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- All user-facing output must use 飞书卡片 format\n- Query flow: 预热卡片(0秒) → 进度卡片(1秒) → 结果卡片(3-8秒) → 导出确认(可选)\n- Result card design: 完整表格保留 + 重点突出(🏆标红加粗) + 排名清晰(按价格排序)\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户要求：信息清晰有层次，表格不简化，只对最优先的进行排名或重点标出\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- msg_id: `om_x100b51338a67eca4b345405225035cb`\n- sender_id: `ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409`\n- replied_to: `om_x100b5133f13120acc45eb5d4f5594a9`\n- sent messageId: `om_x100b513386a044acc2eebbc01336181`\n- chatId: `oc_2dc8a473be229282cffd2b87460dc8a8`\n- skill path: `/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md`\n- skill version: `6.0-streaming-card-output` → target: `6.1`\n\n## Error Details\n- First edit failed: \"Could not find the exact text in /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procur