{"type":"message","id":"266e5134","parentId":"e369c8b5","timestamp":"2026-04-16T08:36:07.327Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a pre-compaction memory flush. I need to append to memory/2026-04-16.md. Let me store the key information from this conversation turn.Key information:- 晁总询问1688 API申请是否有个人门槛\n- 回复：1688 API个人完全可以申请（支付宝实名即可）\n- 对比京东：1688更适合（批发价直接查 + 个人申请简单）- 询问晁总是否有完成实名的支付宝账号"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c0f7zdeo2uou_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md","content":"\n\n\n## 08:35 - 1688 vs 京东 API对比结论\n\n### 晁总询问\n1688 API个人用户申请是否有门槛？\n\n### 对比结论\n\n| 平台 | 个人申请难度 | 核心接口权限 | 推荐度 |\n|------|------------|-------------|--------|\n| **1688** | ⭐ 简单（支付宝就行） | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 批发价直接查 | ✅ 首选 |\n| 京东 | ⭐⭐⭐ 较难（需店铺授权） | ⭐⭐ 商品信息受限 | ❌ 暂不推 |\n\n### 1688申请要求（实际很低）\n- 阿里巴巴账号 ✅\n- 支付宝实名认证 ✅（个人即可）\n- 审核时间：1-2个工作日\n\n### 行动项\n- [ ] 晁总确认是否有完成实名的支付宝账号\n- [ ] 如果有 → 立即开始1688 API申请\n- [ ] 如果无 → 先完成支付宝实名\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776328553906,"responseId":"062fd269b86bf99e670deaf1c67d01ee"}}
