{"type":"message","id":"e83abd71","parentId":"db27a282","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:00:46.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Memory flush. I need to append new content to memory/2026-04-16.md.Key update: 1688 API confirmation - 晁总确认1688也只能是企业才能申请（个人无法申请）。This is important correction to my earlier wrong information."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vplw9l663gtq_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md","content":"\n\n\n## 09:00 - API申请信息修正\n\n### 重要修正\n之前说\"1688个人可申请\"是**错误信息**，已更正。\n\n### 实际情况\n- **1688 API**：2026年起需企业资质，个人无法申请\n- **京东 API**：需店铺授权，个人无法申请\n- **淘宝 API**：个人可申请（但权限受限）\n\n### 晁总确认\n1688也只能是企业才能申请\n\n### 备选方案\n1. **用德胧营业执照申请企业账号**（推荐）\n2. 第三方数据平台（如奇门API，按调用量付费）\n3. 继续用Web搜索作为主要数据源（当前方案）\n\n### 待晁总确认\n- [ ] 德胧是否有营业执照可用\n- [ ] 是否推进企业账号申请\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776330035481,"responseId":"062fd8334ba7e8c9ac3cda5a0257e261"}}
