{"type":"message","id":"5900b083","parentId":"394a5d60","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:00:49.594Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-16 09:00:13 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b513e1f0bdda8c4c1021bcb72671]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b513e1f0bdda8c4c1021bcb72671\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 09:00 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n好的，那目前咱们这个询价的skill那暂时就不去在API这边去费神了，可以进一步去探讨2.0就是之前我说的叫进一步的形成溢价剥离这种底价雷达的功能可以通过一些关键字，比如查询底价或者说剥离溢价，这样的关键字进行设计，或者说是杀到成本价这样的关键字，所以可以立即开始引入研究了，在这个迭代的环节呢，我希望要多检索一些英文的成熟的skill，或者说开源的技能库"}],"timestamp":1776330049535}}
{"type":"message","id":"e9127b3f","parentId":"5900b083","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:00.179Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to:\n1. Pause the API integration work for now\n2. Focus on the next iteration - \"溢价剥离\" (premium stripping) / \"底价雷达\" (floor price radar) feature\n3. Trigger keywords like: \"查询底价\", \"剥离溢价\", \"杀到成本价\"\n4. Research English mature skills and open source skill libraries\n\nThis is a great direction! Let me search for relevant open source skills, GitHub repos, and skill libraries that could help implement this premium stripping / floor price detection concept.\n\nI should search for:\n- Price floor detection algorithms\n- Supplier cost analysis\n- \"Floor price radar\" or similar concepts\n- Open source procurement/price intelligence tools\n- Competitor price monitoring systems"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**收到！方向调整：暂时搁置API申请，全力攻克2.0「溢价剥离底价雷达」！**\n\n立即开始英文skill检索 🔍\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1e9bcfckblz2_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"GitHub hotel procurement price intelligence skill open source agent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1e9bcfckblz2_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Claude agent skill library price monitoring floor cost analysis"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1e9bcfckblz2_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"OpenClaw skills marketplace price comparison procurement radar"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776330049594,"responseId":"062fd841ac199e4bc83389e18f0483f0"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e10a952","parentId":"e9127b3f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:02.124Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1e9bcfckblz2_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"GitHub hotel procurement price intelligence skill open source agent\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - jrojas537/hotel-pricer: Openclaw skill to search for hotels\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/jrojas537/hotel-pricer/\",\n      \"description\": \"<beginning of the code>hotel-pricer<end of the code> is a command-line interface (CLI) tool for searching hotel availability and pricing using the Amadeus Self-Service API. It is designed to be used both by humans and as a skill within the OpenClaw agent framework.\\nFeatures\\nSearch for hotels by city, dates, and number of guests.\\nSecurely stores API credentials.\\nImplements token caching to reduce API calls.\\nOutputs clean,...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - MikkoParkkola/trvl: AI Travel Agent — Google Flights + Hotels. 13 MCP tools, trip optimization, travel hacks. Free, no API keys, single Go binary. · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/mikkoparkkola/trvl\",\n      \"description\": \"<table>\\n<tr><td>\\nMikkoParkkola\\nand\\nclaude</td></tr>\\n</table>\\ntrvl — The Travel MCP Server\\n33 travel tools for your AI assistant — flights, hotels, trains, buses, ferries, price alerts, travel hacks, weather forecasts, baggage rules, destination intel. Free. API-first.\\nAlso works as a standalone CLI with 33 commands.\\nWhat it looks like\\nYou: I have €3...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - Nel-zi/GlobalStay: Automated competitor price tracking and market intelligence for GlobalStay Hotels & Resorts, providing real-time insights into pricing trends across multiple countries to e\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Nel-zi/GlobalStay\",\n      \"description\": \"Competitors have been outperforming GlobalStay by adopting more dynamic pricing strategies, improving customer satisfaction, and enhancing online visibility.\\n-- PROBLEM -- GlobalStay is facing challenges in maintaining competitive pricing and promotional strategies due to outdated and incomplete market data. The current manual process of tracking competitor prices and gathering market intelligence is not only inefficient and time-consuming but also prone to inaccuracies. The company urgently needs to obtain actionable insights into house listings, pricing trends across countries, listing types, enabling data...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"hotel-ai\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/hotel-ai\",\n      \"description\": \"telivity-otaip / haip\\nHAIP (Hotel AI Platform) — Open-source, API-first hotel PMS. TypeScript/Node.js/NestJS.\\nopen-source hotel hotels hotel-api hotel-booking hotel-management-system hotel-reservation-system hotel-ai\\nUpdated Apr 8, 2026\\nTypeScript\\nhospitalityos / hotel-ai-skills\\nClaude AI Plugin Marketplace — Enterprise-grade hotel operations intelligence suite. 10 skills for revenue management...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - IAmTomShaw/quotation-agent: A Python-based AI agent chatbot used for generating service proposals based on your own pricing information 🤑 · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/IAmTomShaw/quotation-agent\",\n      \"description\": \"This agent leverages OpenAI's GPT-4o model and integrates with external APIs to deliver real-time pricing information.\\n🚀 Features\\nReal-time WebSocket Communication: Interactive chat interface with instant responses\\nNotion Integration: Fetches pricing data from Notion database\\nCurrency Conversion: Supports multi-currency quotes using live exchange rates\\nPurpose: Fetches current pricing information from Notion database\\nIntegration: Uses Notion API to retrieve structured pricing data\\n2. Currency Conversion\\nFunction:...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"procurement-automation\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/procurement-automation\",\n      \"description\": \"#\\nprocurement-automation\\nHere are 12 public repositories matching this topic...\\nkamila-dudzinska / Invio\\nProgram do usprawnienia procesu Price Missmatch w dziale AP\\npython\\noutlook\\ninvoice-management\\npandas-python\\nprocurement-processes\\nexcel-automation\\nprice-discrepancy\\nprocurement-automation\\nUpdated Mar 23, 2026\\nPython\\nheysubu / purchase-requisition...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"【GitHub项目推荐--AutoAgent:全自动零代码LLM代理框架】_autoagent github-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/j8267643/article/details/151626900\",\n      \"description\": \"AutoAgent 是香港大学数据科学实验室开发的开源大语言模型代理框架，实现了完全自动化和零代码的LLM 代理创建与部署。通过自然语言交互，用户可以轻松构建功能强大的AI代理和工作流，无需任何编程知识。AutoAgent在GAIA基准测试中展现出与Deep Research相媲美的性能，同时支持多种主流LLM提供商，为开发者和企业提供了高效、低成本的AI代理解决方案。\\n零代码...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Automate Price Monitoring with GitHub + AI\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.arahi.ai/ai-agent/github/price-monitoring\",\n      \"description\": \"How AI Transforms Price Monitoring in GitHub\\nGitHub is a widely-used developer tools platform. Where the world builds software. Millions of developers and companies build, ship, and maintain their software on GitHub—the largest and most advanced development platform in the world. By integrating GitHub with Arahi AI, you automate price monitoring end-to-end — data flows in real-time, tasks execute without manual intervention, and your team focuses on work that actually moves the needle. With the GitHub integration, Arahi AI...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Smart Procurement & Inventory Agent\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/agents-intensive-capstone-project/writeups/smart-procurement-and-inventory-agent\",\n      \"description\": \"This workflow is a perfect fit for agents because it’s not just one model call or one prediction. The system needs to: fetch data from tools (Google Sheets), interpret business rules, decide which items are risky, plan what actions to take, generate human-readable justifications, and then draft emails per supplier. A Summary Tool that generates a natural-language overview of what needs to be reordered and why.\\nAn Email Draft Tool that groups items by supplier and drafts procurement emails.\\nA Logging...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Published Agentic AI solution for RFP/procurement on GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.linkedin.com/posts/shijaz_azureai-aiagents-agenticai-activity-7335244061047410692-PWM1\",\n      \"description\": \"It's a technical solution pattern for orchestrating AI-powered agents to solve complex document evaluation workflows in the context of RFP/procurement business scenario for evaluating supplier proposals. Your procurement process could be an excellent starting point if you're keen on delving into the realm of AI agents and exploring the benefits. Thanks Aadrika Singh and Sarmad for building this IP! GitHub: https://lnkd.in/d8trUmGV #AzureAI #AIagents #agenticAI  #...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"GitHub hotel procurement price intelligence skill open source agent","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"GitHub - jrojas537/hotel-pricer: Openclaw skill to search for hotels","url":"https://github.com/jrojas537/hotel-pricer/","description":"<beginning of the code>hotel-pricer<end of the code> is a command-line interface (CLI) tool for searching hotel availability and pricing using the Amadeus Self-Service API. It is designed to be used both by humans and as a skill within the OpenClaw agent framework.\nFeatures\nSearch for hotels by city, dates, and number of guests.\nSecurely stores API credentials.\nImplements token caching to reduce API calls.\nOutputs clean,...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - MikkoParkkola/trvl: AI Travel Agent — Google Flights + Hotels. 13 MCP tools, trip optimization, travel hacks. Free, no API keys, single Go binary. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/mikkoparkkola/trvl","description":"<table>\n<tr><td>\nMikkoParkkola\nand\nclaude</td></tr>\n</table>\ntrvl — The Travel MCP Server\n33 travel tools for your AI assistant — flights, hotels, trains, buses, ferries, price alerts, travel hacks, weather forecasts, baggage rules, destination intel. Free. API-first.\nAlso works as a standalone CLI with 33 commands.\nWhat it looks like\nYou: I have €3...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - Nel-zi/GlobalStay: Automated competitor price tracking and market intelligence for GlobalStay Hotels & Resorts, providing real-time insights into pricing trends across multiple countries to e","url":"https://github.com/Nel-zi/GlobalStay","description":"Competitors have been outperforming GlobalStay by adopting more dynamic pricing strategies, improving customer satisfaction, and enhancing online visibility.\n-- PROBLEM -- GlobalStay is facing challenges in maintaining competitive pricing and promotional strategies due to outdated and incomplete market data. The current manual process of tracking competitor prices and gathering market intelligence is not only inefficient and time-consuming but also prone to inaccuracies. The company urgently needs to obtain actionable insights into house listings, pricing trends across countries, listing types, enabling data...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"hotel-ai","url":"https://github.com/topics/hotel-ai","description":"telivity-otaip / haip\nHAIP (Hotel AI Platform) — Open-source, API-first hotel PMS. TypeScript/Node.js/NestJS.\nopen-source hotel hotels hotel-api hotel-booking hotel-management-system hotel-reservation-system hotel-ai\nUpdated Apr 8, 2026\nTypeScript\nhospitalityos / hotel-ai-skills\nClaude AI Plugin Marketplace — Enterprise-grade hotel operations intelligence suite. 10 skills for revenue management...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - IAmTomShaw/quotation-agent: A Python-based AI agent chatbot used for generating service proposals based on your own pricing information 🤑 · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/IAmTomShaw/quotation-agent","description":"This agent leverages OpenAI's GPT-4o model and integrates with external APIs to deliver real-time pricing information.\n🚀 Features\nReal-time WebSocket Communication: Interactive chat interface with instant responses\nNotion Integration: Fetches pricing data from Notion database\nCurrency Conversion: Supports multi-currency quotes using live exchange rates\nPurpose: Fetches current pricing information from Notion database\nIntegration: Uses Notion API to retrieve structured pricing data\n2. Currency Conversion\nFunction:...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"procurement-automation","url":"https://github.com/topics/procurement-automation","description":"#\nprocurement-automation\nHere are 12 public repositories matching this topic...\nkamila-dudzinska / Invio\nProgram do usprawnienia procesu Price Missmatch w dziale AP\npython\noutlook\ninvoice-management\npandas-python\nprocurement-processes\nexcel-automation\nprice-discrepancy\nprocurement-automation\nUpdated Mar 23, 2026\nPython\nheysubu / purchase-requisition...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"【GitHub项目推荐--AutoAgent:全自动零代码LLM代理框架】_autoagent github-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/j8267643/article/details/151626900","description":"AutoAgent 是香港大学数据科学实验室开发的开源大语言模型代理框架，实现了完全自动化和零代码的LLM 代理创建与部署。通过自然语言交互，用户可以轻松构建功能强大的AI代理和工作流，无需任何编程知识。AutoAgent在GAIA基准测试中展现出与Deep Research相媲美的性能，同时支持多种主流LLM提供商，为开发者和企业提供了高效、低成本的AI代理解决方案。\n零代码...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Automate Price Monitoring with GitHub + AI","url":"https://www.arahi.ai/ai-agent/github/price-monitoring","description":"How AI Transforms Price Monitoring in GitHub\nGitHub is a widely-used developer tools platform. Where the world builds software. Millions of developers and companies build, ship, and maintain their software on GitHub—the largest and most advanced development platform in the world. By integrating GitHub with Arahi AI, you automate price monitoring end-to-end — data flows in real-time, tasks execute without manual intervention, and your team focuses on work that actually moves the needle. With the GitHub integration, Arahi AI...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Smart Procurement & Inventory Agent","url":"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/agents-intensive-capstone-project/writeups/smart-procurement-and-inventory-agent","description":"This workflow is a perfect fit for agents because it’s not just one model call or one prediction. The system needs to: fetch data from tools (Google Sheets), interpret business rules, decide which items are risky, plan what actions to take, generate human-readable justifications, and then draft emails per supplier. A Summary Tool that generates a natural-language overview of what needs to be reordered and why.\nAn Email Draft Tool that groups items by supplier and drafts procurement emails.\nA Logging...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Published Agentic AI solution for RFP/procurement on GitHub","url":"http://www.linkedin.com/posts/shijaz_azureai-aiagents-agenticai-activity-7335244061047410692-PWM1","description":"It's a technical solution pattern for orchestrating AI-powered agents to solve complex document evaluation workflows in the context of RFP/procurement business scenario for evaluating supplier proposals. Your procurement process could be an excellent starting point if you're keen on delving into the realm of AI agents and exploring the benefits. Thanks Aadrika Singh and Sarmad for building this IP! GitHub: https://lnkd.in/d8trUmGV #AzureAI #AIagents #agenticAI  #...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776330062072}}
{"type":"message","id":"74412930","parentId":"1e10a952","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:02.575Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1e9bcfckblz2_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Claude agent skill library price monitoring floor cost analysis\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Pricing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing?ref=producttalk.org\",\n      \"description\": \"Pricing\\nLearn about Anthropic's pricing structure for models and features\\nThis page provides detailed pricing information for Anthropic's models and features. All prices are in USD.\\nFor the most current pricing information, please visit claude.com/pricing.\\nModel pricing\\nThe following table shows pricing for all Claude models across different usage tiers:\\n<table>\\n<tr><th>Model</th><th>Base Input Tokens</th><th>5m Cache Writes</th><...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Every Plan Explained (With Real Math)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://findskill.ai/blog/claude-code-subscription-pricing-guide/\",\n      \"description\": \"In March 2026, “claude code” hit 1 million searches, up 20x from the year before. At...\\nBudget accordingly.\\nThe honest math: for most full-time developers, Pro at $17-20/month returns more value per dollar than any other AI tool you can buy. The problem isn’t that Claude Code is overpriced — it’s that you might want MORE than what any tier currently offers.\\nWant to level up? \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Pricing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/about-claude/pricing?ref=madewithlove.com\",\n      \"description\": \"On this page\\nModel pricing\\nThird-party platform pricing\\nFeature-specific pricing\\nBatch processing\\nLong context pricing\\nTool use pricing\\nSpecific tool pricing\\nBash t