{"type":"message","id":"69bf92b6","parentId":"57ea9c4e","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:18.038Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_q10b1shhq81s_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"floor price\\\" \\\"cost markup\\\" procurement AI agent skill GitHub\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 9,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Financial Product Pricing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.icecreamtutor.com/notes/finance/financial-terms/financial-product-pricing-2/\",\n      \"description\": \"However, in many actual cases it is difficult for financial companies to estimate costs. Therefore, this method has certain limitations.\\n1) Cost plus method\\nThe cost-plus method is the most basic pricing method. Financial companies set prices by adding a certain proportion of profit to the complete cost (direct cost plus indirect cost). This approach focuses on cost recovery and profit acquisition. The calculation formula is:\\nTotal product price = (direct and indirect) cost + markup\\nProduct unit price = (cost...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Structured Data - v6 - Line Items\",\n      \"url\": \"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v6/LineItem\",\n      \"description\": \"Column Partner Revenue Amount should be specified when column Partner Revenue Model is included.\\nTMCM - Total Media Cost Markup\\nMCM - Media Cost Markup\\nCPM - Cost Per thousand impressions\\nPartner Revenue Amount Required only when column Partner Revenue Model is specified. float Yes A positive float value corresponding to the Partner Revenue Model. Only applicable when column Partner Revenue Model is specified.\\nConversion Counting Type Required when \\\"Type\\\" is \\\"Display\\\" or \\\"Video\\\" or \\\"Audio\\\"...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"SS Price Per Pound: Ultimate Guide to 2024 Market Costs\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.scientificmagz.blog/ss-price-per-pound-market-cost-guide\",\n      \"description\": \"Once new material is purchased—often referencing a supplier’s estimated stainless steel price list —the cost structure shifts drastically away from pure commodity value toward processing costs. The material cost is only the starting point...\\nThe total difference between the mill price and the final fabricated part can range from 50% for simple cuts to 400% or more for highly customized assemblies.\\nThis fabrication markup primarily covers overhead, specialized machinery operation, and Fabrication Labor, which is the most variable financial factor. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"BEER SPIRITS WINE\\nALCOOL ·NB·L\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.anbl.com/medias/0720-B-ANBL_MarkupStructure_SupplierFriendlyEnglish_Current.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"BEER SPIRITS WINE\\nALCOOL ·NB·LIQUOR\\nBIERES SPIRITUEUX VINS\\nMarkup Rates 2022-2023 Effective 17 October 2022\\nSPIRITS\\na) In this section, the 750ml bottle is the reference size, from which the prices of all other sizes are calculated with the factors found in the Spirits Indexing Table.\\nb)...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Display & Video 360 Certification Exam Questions and Answers, Exams of Digital Marketing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.docsity.com/en/docs/display-and-video-360-certification-exam-answers-2025-26-or-google-skillshop-dv360-questions/14817550/\",\n      \"description\": \"The correct answer is: AppNexus, Google Ads Manager, BrightRoll\\n35\\n \\nHow can a...\\nwhat situation would you recommend bidding 20% higher than the\\nfloor price?\\nThe correct answer is: You’re working on a global ad campaign and\\npaying in different currencies\\n100\\nFor non-guaranteed deals in Display & Video 360, when is it\\nrecommended to bid 20% higher than the floor price?\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Untitled\",\n      \"url\": \"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v7/LineItem\",\n      \"description\": \"This could be a simple integer impression value, or a float for a currency amount. Currencies will be...\\nCount %\\nConversion Counting Pct Required when \\\"Type\\\" is \\\"Display\\\" or \\\"Video\\\" or \\\"Audio\\\" or \\\"TrueView\\\" float Yes Specify the % for 'Count %' Conversion Counting Type. Format the % as a float (3.123% = 3.123), with precision limited to the thousands (3 decimal places).\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Untitled\",\n      \"url\": \"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v8/LineItem\",\n      \"description\": \"float Yes A positive float value corresponding to the Partner Revenue Model. Only applicable when column Partner Revenue Model is...\\nCount %\\nConversion Counting Pct Required when \\\"Type\\\" is \\\"Display\\\" or \\\"Video\\\" or \\\"Audio\\\" or \\\"TrueView\\\" float Yes Specify the % for 'Count %' Conversion Counting Type. Format the % as a float (3.123% = 3.123), with precision limited to the thousands (3 decimal places).\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Assessing Value of Adding Flexibility to Washington State’s Greenhouse Gas “Cap and Invest” Program\",\n      \"url\": \"https://scs-public.s3-us-gov-west-1.amazonaws.com/env_production/oid100/did1008/pid_202884/assets/attachments/68166/w60air2_document.pdf?v=43228\",\n      \"description\": \"To address this challenge, at least in the first compliance period, we believe the credit ceiling price should be set at a lower value (e.g., $20, in line with the floor price and the credit value assumed in the legislature’s fiscal analysis of the rule). This is particularly important for a niche refinery like USOR since costs associated with this program will compete with future capital investments to advance the energy transition, such as our “Next Gen” renewable fuel logistics project or our desire to...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Assessing Value of Adding Flexibility to Washington State’s Greenhouse Gas “Cap and Invest” Program\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cleanprosperouswa.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/NERA_WA5126_Study-Overview-and-Modeling-Addendum_1_10_2022_FINAL.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"When the two programs are linked, Washington's allowance prices are projected to approach California's allowance ceiling prices of about $77 in 2024 and $103 in 2030. This result is due to the relative stringency of Washington's program and the additional demand for allowances from the WCI allowance market. The lower allowance price in 2024 is a consequence of an adequate amount of allowances being available such that the allowance price would remain...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"\"floor price\" \"cost markup\" procurement AI agent skill GitHub","provider":"miaoda","count":9,"results":[{"title":"Financial Product Pricing","url":"https://www.icecreamtutor.com/notes/finance/financial-terms/financial-product-pricing-2/","description":"However, in many actual cases it is difficult for financial companies to estimate costs. Therefore, this method has certain limitations.\n1) Cost plus method\nThe cost-plus method is the most basic pricing method. Financial companies set prices by adding a certain proportion of profit to the complete cost (direct cost plus indirect cost). This approach focuses on cost recovery and profit acquisition. The calculation formula is:\nTotal product price = (direct and indirect) cost + markup\nProduct unit price = (cost...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Structured Data - v6 - Line Items","url":"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v6/LineItem","description":"Column Partner Revenue Amount should be specified when column Partner Revenue Model is included.\nTMCM - Total Media Cost Markup\nMCM - Media Cost Markup\nCPM - Cost Per thousand impressions\nPartner Revenue Amount Required only when column Partner Revenue Model is specified. float Yes A positive float value corresponding to the Partner Revenue Model. Only applicable when column Partner Revenue Model is specified.\nConversion Counting Type Required when \"Type\" is \"Display\" or \"Video\" or \"Audio\"...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"SS Price Per Pound: Ultimate Guide to 2024 Market Costs","url":"https://www.scientificmagz.blog/ss-price-per-pound-market-cost-guide","description":"Once new material is purchased—often referencing a supplier’s estimated stainless steel price list —the cost structure shifts drastically away from pure commodity value toward processing costs. The material cost is only the starting point...\nThe total difference between the mill price and the final fabricated part can range from 50% for simple cuts to 400% or more for highly customized assemblies.\nThis fabrication markup primarily covers overhead, specialized machinery operation, and Fabrication Labor, which is the most variable financial factor. ","siteName":""},{"title":"BEER SPIRITS WINE\nALCOOL ·NB·L","url":"https://www.anbl.com/medias/0720-B-ANBL_MarkupStructure_SupplierFriendlyEnglish_Current.pdf","description":"BEER SPIRITS WINE\nALCOOL ·NB·LIQUOR\nBIERES SPIRITUEUX VINS\nMarkup Rates 2022-2023 Effective 17 October 2022\nSPIRITS\na) In this section, the 750ml bottle is the reference size, from which the prices of all other sizes are calculated with the factors found in the Spirits Indexing Table.\nb)...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Display & Video 360 Certification Exam Questions and Answers, Exams of Digital Marketing","url":"https://www.docsity.com/en/docs/display-and-video-360-certification-exam-answers-2025-26-or-google-skillshop-dv360-questions/14817550/","description":"The correct answer is: AppNexus, Google Ads Manager, BrightRoll\n35\n \nHow can a...\nwhat situation would you recommend bidding 20% higher than the\nfloor price?\nThe correct answer is: You’re working on a global ad campaign and\npaying in different currencies\n100\nFor non-guaranteed deals in Display & Video 360, when is it\nrecommended to bid 20% higher than the floor price?\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Untitled","url":"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v7/LineItem","description":"This could be a simple integer impression value, or a float for a currency amount. Currencies will be...\nCount %\nConversion Counting Pct Required when \"Type\" is \"Display\" or \"Video\" or \"Audio\" or \"TrueView\" float Yes Specify the % for 'Count %' Conversion Counting Type. Format the % as a float (3.123% = 3.123), with precision limited to the thousands (3 decimal places).\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Untitled","url":"http://api2google.com/display-video/api/structured-data-file/v8/LineItem","description":"float Yes A positive float value corresponding to the Partner Revenue Model. Only applicable when column Partner Revenue Model is...\nCount %\nConversion Counting Pct Required when \"Type\" is \"Display\" or \"Video\" or \"Audio\" or \"TrueView\" float Yes Specify the % for 'Count %' Conversion Counting Type. Format the % as a float (3.123% = 3.123), with precision limited to the thousands (3 decimal places).\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Assessing Value of Adding Flexibility to Washington State’s Greenhouse Gas “Cap and Invest” Program","url":"https://scs-public.s3-us-gov-west-1.amazonaws.com/env_production/oid100/did1008/pid_202884/assets/attachments/68166/w60air2_document.pdf?v=43228","description":"To address this challenge, at least in the first compliance period, we believe the credit ceiling price should be set at a lower value (e.g., $20, in line with the floor price and the credit value assumed in the legislature’s fiscal analysis of the rule). This is particularly important for a niche refinery like USOR since costs associated with this program will compete with future capital investments to advance the energy transition, such as our “Next Gen” renewable fuel logistics project or our desire to...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Assessing Value of Adding Flexibility to Washington State’s Greenhouse Gas “Cap and Invest” Program","url":"https://www.cleanprosperouswa.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/NERA_WA5126_Study-Overview-and-Modeling-Addendum_1_10_2022_FINAL.pdf","description":"When the two programs are linked, Washington's allowance prices are projected to approach California's allowance ceiling prices of about $77 in 2024 and $103 in 2030. This result is due to the relative stringency of Washington's program and the additional demand for allowances from the WCI allowance market. The lower allowance price in 2024 is a consequence of an adequate amount of allowances being available such that the allowance price would remain...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776330077992}}
{"type":"message","id":"1dd0329b","parentId":"69bf92b6","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:28.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found some good references. Let me look at the key findings:\n\n1. **Price Tracker skill on ClawHub** - monitors product prices across Amazon, eBay, Walmart, Best Buy - this is similar to what we want\n2. **Competitor Monitor** - Chinese skill for monitoring Taobao/JD/Pinduoduo/Amazon prices\n3. **hotel-pricer** - OpenClaw skill for hotel price searching using Amadeus API\n\nLet me look at ClawHub more specifically and search for more relevant skills."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0ew4436ow317_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"clawhub.ai procurement price intelligence markup analysis"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0ew4436ow317_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com \"price intelligence\" OR \"cost analysis\" hotel restaurant procurement"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776330078040,"responseId":"062fd85e984f78cae41e0ad0550c2ee1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6c188d43","parentId":"1dd0329b","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:30.821Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0ew4436ow317_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"clawhub.ai procurement price intelligence markup analysis\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Price Tracker\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/Michael-laffin/price-tracker\",\n      \"description\": \"Track product prices across multiple e-commerce platforms to identify arbitrage opportunities, profit margins, and optimal...\\nCompare identical product prices across platforms\\nCalculate profit margins after fees and shipping\\nIdentify flip-worthy opportunities (20%+ margin after costs)\\nFactor in platform fees, shipping costs, and taxes\\nFee Structure Reference:\\nAmazon: ~15% referral fee\\neBay: ~13% final value fee + listing fees\\nWalmart: ~8-15% referral fee\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"从需求到定价:OpenClaw产品全生命周期AI提效实战指南-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/RickyIT/article/details/160085138\",\n      \"description\": \"定价策略辅助Skill（<beginning of the code>Pricing Strategy<end of the code> ）是OpenClaw针对产品定价场景的核心插件，支持从产品定价背景、成本结构、竞品价格、用户价值等输入，自动分析定价问题、设计分层定价方案、评估收益影响、输出定价优化建议。其核心工作流程如下：\\n成本测算不准确\\n解决：补充竞品最新价格、用户调研数据，让AI基于真实市场定价；\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI Cost Models Expose Hidden Gaps In Supplier Quotes\",\n      \"url\": \"https://supplychain360.io/ai-cost-models-expose-hidden-gaps-in-supplier-quotes/\",\n      \"description\": \"But AI-powered cost engines dig deeper, decomposing line items, indexing cost drivers, and benchmarking across peer cohorts. In many cases, they reveal a hidden 8–12% premium embedded by one vendor, not due to input inflation, but due to strategic markup during periods of customer urgency or limited market scrutiny. These insights are prompting a shift from price comparison to price justification.\\nSourcing teams are no longer merely asking “which offer is cheaper?”—they’re asking “which...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Browser Commerce Base cho Openclaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/vi/openclaw-skills/browser-e-commerce-20742\",\n      \"description\": \" cho phép các tác nhân AI xử lý việc duyệt sản phẩm công khai và dữ liệu tài khoản đã đăng nhập an toàn với các hồ sơ trình duyệt riêng biệt....\\n<tr><td>current_price</td><td>Giá cơ bản được niêm yết trên trang sản phẩm.</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>final_price</td><td>Giá sau khi áp dụng phiếu giảm giá, trợ cấp hoặc giảm giá thành viên.</td></tr>\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Openclaw용 중국 가전 소싱\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/ko/openclaw-skills/china-home-appliances-sourcing-20671\",\n      \"description\": \"1. ClawHub CLI\\n레지스트리에서 스킬을 바로 설치하는 가장 빠른 방법입니다.\\nnpx clawhub@latest install china-home-appliances-sourcing\\nClawhub를 사용해서 china-home-appliances-sourcing 설치를 도와줘. Clawhub가 설치...\\nAI 에이전트가 가전 카테고리 또는 소싱 지역에 대한 사용자의 특정 쿼리를 분석합니다.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"price-monitor for Openclaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/openclaw-skills/price-monitor-19693\",\n      \"description\": \"It eliminates the need for manual site checks by providing a programmable framework to watch for specific triggers, such as price drops or restock events, ensuring you never miss a critical change on the web.\\nprice-monitor Use Cases\\nMonitoring product price drops on major e-commerce platforms like Amazon or Best Buy.\\nReceiving instant notifications when high-demand, out-of-stock items become available.\\nBuilding a comprehensive historical price database for market analysis and trend forecasting.\\nTracking competitor website changes, promotional updates...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI Pricing Intelligence: Track Competitor Pricing Changes Automatically [2026]\",\n      \"url\": \"https://marketbetter.ai/blog/ai-pricing-intelligence-competitor-tracking/\",\n      \"description\": \"Feature repackaging (moved between tiers)\\n4. New add-ons or modules\\n5. Changed billing models (monthly vs annual)\\n6. New discount structures\\n7. Free tier changes\\nOUTPUT: Structured diff with significance rating (1-10)\\nNot every change matters equally. Component 4: Sales Enablement Response\\nDetection without action is useless. The system should automatically:\\nUpdate Battle Cards: When a competitor changes pricing, their battle card...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Openclaw용 중국 소비자 가전 소싱\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/ko/openclaw-skills/china-consumer-electronics-sourcing-20668\",\n      \"description\": \"1. ClawHub CLI\\n레지스트리에서 스킬을 바로 설치하는 가장 빠른 방법입니다.\\nnpx clawhub@latest install china-consumer-electronics-sourcing\\n<beginning of the code>~/.open...\\nClawhub를 사용해서 china-consumer-electronics-sourcing 설치를 도와줘. Clawhub가 설치되어 있지 않다면 먼저 설치해 줘 (npm i -g clawhub).\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"clawhub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/clawhub\",\n      \"description\": \"agent...\\nUnlimited possibilities. Powered by MyClaw.ai\\nautomation skills ai-server ai-agent openclaw clawhub myclaw\\nUpdated Apr 2, 2026\\nhashgraph-online / registry-broker-skills\\nAI agent skills for the Universal Registry - search, chat, and register 72,000+ agents across 14+ protocols. Works with Claude, Codex, Cursor, OpenClaw, and any AI assistant.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Openclaw용 China Apparel & Accessories Sourcing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/ko/openclaw-skills/china-apparel-and-accessories-sourcing-20667\",\n      \"description\": \"1. ClawHub CLI\\n레지스트리에서 스킬을 바로 설치하는 가장 빠른 방법입니다.\\nnpx clawhub@latest install china-apparel-and-accessories-sourcing\\n<beginning of the code>~...\\nClawhub를 사용해서 china-apparel-and-accessories-sourcing 설치를 도와줘. Clawhub가 설치되어 있지 않다면 먼저 설치해 줘 (npm i -g clawhub).\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"clawhub.ai procurement price intelligence markup analysis","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"Price Tracker","url":"https://clawhub.ai/Michael-laffin/price-tracker","description":"Track product prices across multiple e-commerce platforms to identify arbitrage opportunities, profit margins, and optimal...\nCompare identical product prices across platforms\nCalculate profit margins after fees and shipping\nIdentify flip-worthy opportunities (20%+ margin after costs)\nFactor in platform fees, shipping costs, and taxes\nFee Structure Reference:\nAmazon: ~15% referral fee\neBay: ~13% final value fee + listing fees\nWalmart: ~8-15% referral fee\n","siteName":""},{"title":"从需求到定价:OpenClaw产品全生命周期AI提效实战指南-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/RickyIT/article/details/160085138","description":"定价策略辅助Skill（<beginning of the code>Pricing Strategy<end of the code> ）是OpenClaw针对产品定价场景的核心插件，支持从产品定价背景、成本结构、竞品价格、用户价值等输入，自动分析定价问题、设计分层定价方案、评估收益影响、输出定价优化建议。其核心工作流程如下：\n成本测算不准确\n解决：补充竞品最新价格、用户调研数据，让AI基于真实市场定价；\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI Cost Models Expose Hidden Gaps In Supplier Quotes","url":"https://supplychain360.io/ai-cost-models-expose-hidden-gaps-in-supplier-quotes/","description":"But AI-powered cost engines dig deeper, decomposing line items, indexing cost drivers, and benchmarking across peer cohorts. In many cases, they reveal a hidden 8–12% premium embedded by one vendor, not due to input inflation, but due to strategic markup during periods of customer urgency or limited market scrutiny. These insights are prompting a shift from price comparison to price justification.\nSourcing teams are no longer merely asking “which offer is cheaper?”—they’re asking “which...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Browser Commerce Base 