{"type":"message","id":"9e8694ac","parentId":"72e02372","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:01:51.204Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found some useful references. Let me compile what I've found and present a summary to 晁总:\n\n1. **Price Tracker on ClawHub** (https://clawhub.ai/Michael-laffin/price-tracker) - This is an existing OpenClaw skill that tracks prices across e-commerce platforms\n\n2. **Competitor Monitor** - A Chinese skill for monitoring competitor prices on Taobao/JD/Pinduoduo/Amazon\n\n3. **China Sourcing skills** on ClawHub - Various sourcing skills for Chinese products\n\n4. **Pricing Strategy skill** - OpenClaw skill for pricing strategy assistance\n\n5. **Supply chain AI cost models** - Enterprise-grade cost analysis that reveals hidden markups (8-12% premium)\n\n6. **CropAI India** - Agricultural price analysis with profit margin calculations\n\nKey concept: \"溢价剥离\" = markup stripping / premium removal\n\nLet me present a structured summary to 晁总 with the research findings and potential approaches for v2.0."},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 英文skill检索完成！** 发现了一些很有价值的参考：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 检索结果汇总\n\n### 1. ClawHub 已有相关Skill\n\n| Skill | 功能 | 来源 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| **Price Tracker** | 多平台价格追踪 + 利润计算 | ClawHub官方 |\n| **Competitor Monitor** | 竞品价格监控（淘宝/京东/拼多多/亚马逊） | 中国团队 |\n| **Pricing Strategy** | 定价策略辅助（成本结构 + 竞品定价） | OpenClaw |\n| **China Sourcing** | 中国采购 sourcing 工具 | ClawHub |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 英文市场的成熟方案\n\n| 方案 | 特点 |\n|------|------|\n| **Price Tracker** | 跨平台比价 + 利润计算 + 套利机会识别 |\n| **AI Cost Models** (Enterprise) | 揭示隐藏溢价（8-12% markup） |\n| **CropAI** | 农产品价格分析 + 利润计算 |\n\n---\n\n### 3. 关键技术点\n\n**\"溢价剥离\"的核心算法：**\n```\n市场价 ÷ 成本基准 = 溢价倍数\n```\n\n**参考公式：**\n- 平台费（Amazon ~15%, eBay ~13%）\n- 运费\n- 毛利率目标\n- **最终剥离出\"真实成本\"**\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 v2.0「溢价剥离底价雷达」设计方向\n\n**触发关键词：**\n- \"查底价\"\n- \"剥离溢价\"\n- \"杀到成本价\"\n- \"真实成本\"\n- \"水分多少\"\n\n**核心能力：**\n1. **输入**：当前市场报价\n2. **分析**：\n   - 去除平台/渠道溢价\n   - 计算裸成本\n   - 给出\"杀价空间\"\n3. **输出**：成本拆解 + 建议采购价\n\n---\n\n**要我把Price Tracker的源码逻辑研究一下，借鉴到咱们的v2.0设计里？** 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776330090868,"responseId":"062fd86acc4414c8613dbd1ba17b7e6b"}}
