ge(sku_id)<end of the code>\\n插件背后的 bridge service\\n<beginning of the code>plugins.entries[\\\"jd-shop\\\"].config.baseUrl<end of the code> 我建议接到你自己的本地 bridge，比如：\\n<beginning of the code>GET /search?keyword=......\\n京东商品搜索 + 比价 + 打开商品页\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n   ...\n- Tool result (web_search): {\n  \"query\": \"京东开放平台 API Python SDK 1688对接龙虾\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"获取商品详情分类主图sku等信息|淘宝京东1688实时API接口_alibaba.category.get-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/Ob_API20230201/article/details/148220153\",\n      \"description\": \"京东宙斯平台（Jingdong Zeus）：聚焦电商核心业务场景，提供商品查询、价格监控、库存同步等 API，采用...\\n1688 开放平台（1688 Open Platform）：针对批发采购场景，开放商品详情、供应商信息、批发价格等接口，与淘宝开放平台共享部分底层架构。\\n2.3.1 认证流程\\n通过京东宙斯平台获取client_id和client_secret\\n使用授权码模式获取access_token\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"超清晰教程:Python 调用京东商品详情 API(完整可运行)-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      ...\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] \n\n**目前没有现成的京东 SKILL**，但有两条路可以走：\n\n---\n\n**方案一：自建 MCP Server（推荐）**\n\n京东有开放平台 API，可以写一个 MCP Server 对接 OpenClaw：\n\n```\n京东开放平台 API\n    ↓\nMCP Server (Python)\n    ↓\nOpenClaw MCP 集成\n    ↓\n自然语言查询京东商品/价格\n```\n\n**优势**：一次开发，多个 AI Agent 都能用\n\n---\n\n**方案二：参考 1688 SKILL 开发 Python 脚本**\n\n你之前部署的 `jd-taobao-api-guide` SKILL 可以参考。1688 SKILL 里已经有：\n- ✅ API 申请流程文档\n- ✅ Python 调用示例\n- ✅ 签名生成代码\n\n**京东 API 调用流程类似**，可以复用这套框架。\n\n---\n\n**京东开放平台需要申请**：\n\n| 项目 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台 | https://open.jd.com |\n| 认证 | 企业/个人开发者 |\n| API Key | appkey + appsecret |\n| 审核 | 自研应用免审核 |\n\n---\n\n**要不要我把 1688 SKILL 里的调用框架复制一份，帮...\n- User: Pre-compaction memory flush. Store durable memories only in memory/2026-04-16.md (create memory/ if needed). Treat workspace bootstrap/reference files such as MEMORY.md, DREAMS.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, and AGENTS.md as read-only during this flush; never overwrite, replace, or edit them. If memory/2026-04-16.md already exists, APPEND new content only and do not overwrite existing entries. Do NOT create timestamped variant files (e.g., 2026-04-16-HHMM.md); always use the canonical 2026-04-16.md filename. If nothing to store, reply with NO_REPLY.\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 16th, 2026 - 8:02 AM (...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (write): Appended content to memory/2026-04-16.md.\n- Assistant: HEARTBEAT_OK\n[non-text content: thinking]\n\n<read-files>\n/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md\n/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/jd-taobao-api-guide/SKILL.md\n\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md\n\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"787b27df","tokensBefore":0,"details":{"readFiles":["/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md","/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/jd-taobao-api-guide/SKILL.md"],"modifiedFiles":["/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md"]},"fromHook":true}
