{"type":"message","id":"78a3406e","parentId":"54b71582","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:13:35.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a pre-compaction memory flush. Let me append the latest context about the v2.0 \"溢价剥离底价雷达\" feature discussion."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8ec2s7pmcahb_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md","content":"\n\n\n## 09:13 - v2.0「溢价剥离底价雷达」方向确认\n\n### 晁总指令\n1. 暂时搁置API申请\n2. 全力研发v2.0「溢价剥离底价雷达」\n3. 多检索英文成熟skill和开源技能库\n\n### 触发关键词（待设计）\n- \"查底价\"\n- \"剥离溢价\"\n- \"杀到成本价\"\n- \"真实成本\"\n- \"水分多少\"\n\n### v2.0核心能力（初步设计）\n1. **输入**：当前市场报价\n2. **分析**：去除平台/渠道溢价 → 计算裸成本 → 给出杀价空间\n3. **输出**：成本拆解 + 建议采购价\n\n### 英文skill检索结果\n- ClawHub: Price Tracker, Competitor Monitor, Pricing Strategy\n- 关键技术：平台费率（Amazon ~15%, eBay ~13%）+ 成本基准剥离算法\n\n### 待跟进\n- [ ] 研究Price Tracker源码逻辑\n- [ ] 设计v2.0溢价剥离算法\n- [ ] 更新SKILL至v8.0\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776330805637,"responseId":"062fdb350195fccac94c60d9b3fe3acc"}}
