{"type":"message","id":"6b1cef7c","parentId":"527fc825","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:13:52.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying:\n1. Don't casually install skills, only TOP1-2 in each category\n2. First priority: Find and deploy a SKILL security detection skill\n3. Don't install low-star skills\n4. Also search GitHub for the best SKILLs in this area first\n5. After security SKILL is done, then consider other TOP SKILLs\n\nLet me search for:\n1. OpenClaw SKILL security scanning/detection\n2. GitHub SKILL security for AI agents\n3. ClawHub security-related SKILLs\n\nThis is very important - security before adding anything else."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**完全同意！安全第一！立即检索SKILL安全检测工具 🔒**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"clawhub.ai security scan vulnerability detection skill openclaw"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com openclaw skill security audit vulnerability scanner"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"AI agent skill security check malicious code detection GitHub"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776330820425,"responseId":"062fdb44538b48f3b7c85ca1e38c1700"}}
{"type":"message","id":"26e3258f","parentId":"6b1cef7c","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:13:54.576Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"clawhub.ai security scan vulnerability detection skill openclaw\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"A.I.G\",\n      \"url\": \"https://matrix.tencent.com/clawscan/\",\n      \"description\": \"1、Cl...\\n2、Skillhub 安装指令：请先检查是否已安装 SkillHub 商店，若未安装，请根据 https://skillhub-1388575217.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/install/skillhub.md 安装 Skillhub 商店，然后安装 edgeone-clawscan 技能。若已安装，则直接安装 edgeone-clawscan 技能，最后使用 edgeone-clawscan 进行安全体检。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Claw Security Scanner\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/BetsyMalthus/claw-security-scanner\",\n      \"description\": \"Claw Security Scanner\\n自动扫描OpenClaw技能文件，检测恶意代码、凭据泄露、依赖漏洞及权限风险，提供安全评估与修复建议。\\nMIT-0 · Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.\\nby\\nSkilledClaw · @BetsyMalthus\\nMIT-0\\nSecurity Scan\\nVirusTotal\\nBenign\\nOpenClaw\\nOpenClaw\\nSuspicious\\nmedium confidence\\nThe package mostly matches a...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Skill Scanner\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/Trypto1019/arc-skill-scanner\",\n      \"description\": \"Skill Scanner\\nScan OpenClaw skills for security vulnerabilities before installing them. Use when evaluating a new skill from ClawHub or any third-party source. Detects cre...\\nMIT-0 · Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.\\nby\\nSkill Scanner\\nScan OpenClaw skills for security issues before you install them. 341 malicious skills were found on ClawHub — don't be the next victim.\\nWhy This Exists\\nThe Claw...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Agent Audit Scanner\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/HeadyZhang/agent-audit-scanner\",\n      \"description\": \"Name/description (security scanner for OpenClaw skills) aligns with required binaries (python3), declared file_reads (~/.openclaw/skills/** and ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json) and the bundled scripts which discover and scan skill directories. Reading those paths is expected for this purpose.\\nInstruction Scope\\nSKILL.md and bundled scripts instruct the agent to read all managed/workspace skills and the OpenClaw config, run the bundled Python scripts, and invoke...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenA2A Security\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/abdelsfane/opena2a-security\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenA2A Security\\nSecurity hardening for OpenClaw. Audit your configuration, scan installed skills for malware, detect CVE-2026-25253, check credential exposure, and get actio...\\nMIT-0 · Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.\\nby\\nAbdel Fane · @abdelsfane\\nMIT-0\\nSecurity Scan\\nVirusTotal\\nBenign\\nOpenClaw\\nOpenClaw...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Yoder Skill Auditor\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/yoder-bawt/yoder-skill-auditor\",\n      \"description\": \"sh will call the external `clawhub` CLI and download skills to a temp dir, which implies network access when used.\\nCredentials\\nThe skill declares no required environment variables or secrets and only requires python3 and bash, which is proportional. That said the codebase contains detection patterns that reference many secret names (OPENAI_API_KEY, AWS credentials, BW_SESSION, etc.) which is expected for a scanner. Also some test fixtures contain explicit reads of ~/.ssh, ~/.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Openclaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawhub.ai/zscole/openclaw\",\n      \"description\": \"This skill appears coherent for its purpose: it instructs agents to use the 1Password CLI to retrieve short-lived session keys, sanitize outputs, and enforce allowlists/confirmations. Before installing: 1) Confirm the skill origin and the homepage/owner (source is listed as unknown); the SKILL.md uses the internal name 'bagman' while the registry entry is 'Openclaw' — verify that mismatch with the publisher. 2) Ensure you only grant agents session...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/11014\",\n      \"description\": \"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014\\nLabels\\nenhancement\\nsecurity\\ncoygeek\\nProblem Statement\\nOpenClaw's extension and hook system allows skills to execute shell commands, read and write files, and make network requests on the user's machine. Currently there is no security validation layer that inspects skill code or manifests before execution. This means a malicious or compromised skill can silently exfiltrate data...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"[Feature]: skill:pre-install and skill:post-install Hook Events #23926\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/23926\",\n      \"description\": \"Our scanner flagged 568 skills (4.4%) as potentially dangerous based on pattern matching against known attack techniques (shell injection, data exfiltration, credential access, memory poisoning, prompt injection).\\nAmong the findings:\\nMass-published duplicate skills: 16 unique skill names (e.g., <beginning of the code>youtube-summarize<end of the code>, <beginning of the code>auto-updater<end of the code>, <...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Show HN: RankClaw – AI-audited all 14,706 OpenClaw skills; 1,103 are malicious\",\n      \"url\": \"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47287985\",\n      \"description\": \"Data: - 14,706 skills indexed - Every single skill has a full AI deep audit report (14,704 complete) - 1,103 confirmed malicious (7.5%)\\nThe key finding: automated surface scanning (metadata, dependency checks, pattern matching) systematically undercounts malicious skills. Skills that pass shallow heuristics fail AI audit because the attack is in the natural language of the SKILL.md — prompt injection, deferred execution,...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"clawhub.ai security scan vulnerability detection skill openclaw","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"A.I.G","url":"https://matrix.tencent.com/clawscan/","description":"1、Cl...\n2、Skillhub 安装指令：请先检查是否已安装 SkillHub 商店，若未安装，请根据 https://skillhub-1388575217.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/install/skillhub.md 安装 Skillhub 商店，然后安装 edgeone-clawscan 技能。若已安装，则直接安装 edgeone-clawscan 技能，最后使用 edgeone-clawscan 进行安全体检。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Claw Security Scanner","url":"https://clawhub.ai/BetsyMalthus/claw-security-scanner","description":"Claw Security Scanner\n自动扫描OpenClaw技能文件，检测恶意代码、凭据泄露、依赖漏洞及权限风险，提供安全评估与修复建议。\nMIT-0 · Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.\nby\nSkilledClaw · @BetsyMalthus\nMIT-0\nSecurity Scan\nVirusTotal\nBenign\nOpenClaw\nOpenClaw\nSuspicious\nmedium confidence\nThe package mostly matches a...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Skill Scanner","url":"https://clawhub.ai/Trypto1019/arc-skill-scanner","description":"Skill Scanner\nScan OpenClaw skills for security vulnerabilities before installing them. Use when evaluating a new skill from ClawHub or any third-party source. Detects cre...\nMIT-0 · Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.\nby\nSkill Scanner\nScan OpenClaw skills for security issues before you install them. 341 malicious skills were found on ClawHub — don't be the next victim.\nWhy This Exists\nThe Claw...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Agent Audit Scanner","url":"https://clawhub.a