man' while the registry entry is 'Openclaw' — verify that mismatch with the publisher. 2) Ensure you only grant agents session...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/11014","description":"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014\nLabels\nenhancement\nsecurity\ncoygeek\nProblem Statement\nOpenClaw's extension and hook system allows skills to execute shell commands, read and write files, and make network requests on the user's machine. Currently there is no security validation layer that inspects skill code or manifests before execution. This means a malicious or compromised skill can silently exfiltrate data...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"[Feature]: skill:pre-install and skill:post-install Hook Events #23926","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/23926","description":"Our scanner flagged 568 skills (4.4%) as potentially dangerous based on pattern matching against known attack techniques (shell injection, data exfiltration, credential access, memory poisoning, prompt injection).\nAmong the findings:\nMass-published duplicate skills: 16 unique skill names (e.g., <beginning of the code>youtube-summarize<end of the code>, <beginning of the code>auto-updater<end of the code>, <...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Show HN: RankClaw – AI-audited all 14,706 OpenClaw skills; 1,103 are malicious","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47287985","description":"Data: - 14,706 skills indexed - Every single skill has a full AI deep audit report (14,704 complete) - 1,103 confirmed malicious (7.5%)\nThe key finding: automated surface scanning (metadata, dependency checks, pattern matching) systematically undercounts malicious skills. Skills that pass shallow heuristics fail AI audit because the attack is in the natural language of the SKILL.md — prompt injection, deferred execution,...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776330834487}}
{"type":"message","id":"1660e4e3","parentId":"26e3258f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:13:54.678Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"site:github.com openclaw skill security audit vulnerability scanner\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"🛡️ Ronald Skill Auditor\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Gotbuds/skill-auditor\",\n      \"description\": \"Gotbuds/skill-auditor\\nCode\\n<table>\\n<tr><td>Gotbuds</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>checks</td><td>checks</td><td>Initial commit - Ronald Skill Auditor v1.0</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>reports</td><td>reports</td><td>Initial commit - Ronald Skill Auditor v1.0</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/11014\",\n      \"description\": \"Pros: tightly integrated, covers OpenClaw-specific patterns. Cons: significant development effort, reinvents well-tested detection logic.\\nRecommended: Hybrid approach - Adopt Cisco's YARA rules and detection patterns as a foundation, add OpenClaw-specific checks (hook validation, plugin registry isolation, sandbox enforcement), and integrate as a native pre-execution gate.\\nUse Case Example\\nOpenClaw's own documentation acknowledges \\\"There is no 'perfectly secure' setup\\\" - this proposal...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"ClawSecure — OpenClaw Security Scanner & Audit Platform\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/ClawSecure/clawsecure-openclaw-security\",\n      \"description\": \"ClawSecure is the independent integrity layer for the OpenClaw ecosystem — a free OpenClaw security scanner and audit platform purpose-built for AI agent skills and workflows. <tr><td>Free Web-Based Scanning</td><td>No installation required — paste any ClawHub skill URL, GitHub link, or skill...\\nClawSecure is the independent AI agent security scanner and integrity layer for AI agent skills and workflows, providing the security infrastructure the OpenClaw ecosystem needs to scale safely. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - CoChatAI/openclaw-carapace: Security auditor, CVE scanner, and skill analyzer for OpenClaw gateways · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/cochatai/openclaw-carapace\",\n      \"description\": \"Carapace For OpenClaw\\nThe openclaw Security Advisor for OpenClaw gateways .\\nBuilt by CoChat.\\nRun one command. See exactly what's wrong with your gateway and how to fix it. Your config -- 24 rules catch misconfigurations in authentication, sandboxing, tool permissions, exec approvals, filesystem restrictions, DM policies, and more. Each finding explains the risk and tells you the fix.\\nKnown vulnerabilities -- Carapace fetches...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - gavin2us/clawshield: Security scanner for OpenClaw skills - detect malicious patterns, data exfiltration, and supply chain risks · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/gavin2us/clawshield\",\n      \"description\": \"Why ClawShield?\\nOpenClaw skills can execute code, access files, make network requests, and read secrets. A malicious skill can:\\n🔑 Steal API keys and credentials\\n📤 Exfiltrate sensitive data\\n💰 Hijack crypto wallets\\n🚪 Install backdoors and persistence mechanisms\\n⛏️ Run cryptominers\\nClawShield catches these threats before you install.\\nClawShield includes 30+ detection rules across categories:\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"docs: update What's New for v4.1.2, fix vuln counts and add openclaw to component table #278\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/pull/278/files\",\n      \"description\": \"docs: update What's New for v4.1.2, fix vuln counts and add openclaw to component table #278\\nNew issue\\nApr 3, 2026\\nFiles changed 5\\nREADME.md\\n@@ -50,13 +50,22 @@\\n<br>\\n## 🚀 What's New: Agent Skills Security Scanner\\n## 🚀 What's New in v4.1.2\\n- ...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - Panda-Intelligence/openclaw-security: OpenClaw Security Audit Tool · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Panda-Intelligence/openclaw-security\",\n      \"description\": \"Security audit platform for OpenClaw Cloud deployments. Think Lighthouse + Wappalyzer, but for AI agent infrastructure.\\nPaste a URL, get a structured security report — no auth required for passive scans, JWT-paired deep scans for full config auditing.\\nFeatures\\n20 security checks — 14 passive (headers, CORS, TLS, endpoints, error disclosure) + 6 active (JWT, agent config, memory injection, skills, schedules, channels...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - prompt-security/clawsec: A complete security skill suite for OpenClaw's and NanoClaw agents (and variants). Protect your SOUL.md (etc') with drift detection, live security recommendations, au\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/prompt-security/clawsec\",\n      \"description\": \"Prompt injection patterns\\nAgent security vulnerabilities\\nExploitability Context\\nClawSec enriches CVE advisories with exploitability context to help agents assess real-world risk beyond raw CVSS scores. Newly analyzed advisories can include:\\nExploit Evidence: Whether public exploits exist in the wild\\nWeaponization Status: If exploits are integrated into common attack frameworks\\nAttack Requirements: Prerequisites needed for successful exploitation (network access, authentication, user interaction)\\nRisk Assessment: Contextualized...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - adversa-ai/secureclaw: SecureClaw - Security Plugin and Skill for OpenClaw OWASP-Aligned · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/adversa-ai/secureclaw\",\n      \"description\": \"SecureClaw is a 360-degree security plugin and skills that audits your OpenClaw installation for misconfigurations and known vulnerabilities, applies automated hardening fixes, and gives your agent behavioral security rules that protect against prompt injection, credential theft, supply chain attacks, and privacy leaks.\\n1️⃣ Full OWASP Agentic Security Top 10 coverage. Static and runtime. We're the first and only security tool for OpenClaw to formally map every control to the AS...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - hidearmoon/clawguard: Security audit & vulnerability scanner for OpenClaw AI API Gateway deployments · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/hidearmoon/clawguard\",\n      \"description\": \"ClawGuard automatically detects configuration mistakes, outdated dependencies with known CVEs, and API permission anomalies in your OpenClaw deployment — then generates a professional audit report for compliance or internal review.\\n✨ Features\\n<table>\\n<tr><th>Category</th><th>What ClawGuard checks</th></tr>\\nMIT © OpenClaw Labs\\nClawGuard（中文文档）\\n🛡️ 面向 OpenClaw AI API 网关的自动化安全审计与漏洞扫描...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"site:github.com openclaw skill security audit vulnerability scanner","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"🛡️ Ronald Skill Auditor","url":"https://github.com/Gotbuds/skill-auditor","description":"Gotbuds/skill-auditor\nCode\n<table>\n<tr><td>Gotbuds</td></tr>\n<tr><td>checks</td><td>checks</td><td>Initial commit - Ronald Skill Auditor v1.0</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>reports</td><td>reports</td><td>Initial commit - Ronald Skill Auditor v1.0</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"[Feature]: Add skill/extension security scanning pipeline to detect malicious skills before execution #11014","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/11014","description":"Pros: tightly integrated, covers OpenClaw-specific patterns. Cons: significant development effort, reinvents well-tested detection logic.\nRecommended: Hybrid approach - Adopt Cisco's YARA rules and detection patterns as a foundation, add OpenClaw-specific checks (hook validation, plugin registry isolation, sandbox enforcement), and integrate as a native pre-execution gate.\nUse Case Example\nOpenClaw's own documentation acknowledges \"There is no 'perfectly secure' setup\" - this proposal...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"ClawSecure — OpenClaw Security Scanner & Audit Platform","url":"https://github.com/ClawSecure/clawsecure-openclaw-security","description":"ClawSecure is the independent integrity layer for the OpenClaw ecosystem — a free OpenClaw security scanner and audit platform purpose-built for AI agent skills and workflows. <tr><td>Free Web-Based Scanning</td><td>No installation required — paste any ClawHub skill URL, GitHub link, or skill...\nClawSecure is the independent AI agent security scanner and integrity layer for AI agent skills and workflows, providing the security infrastructure the OpenClaw ecosystem needs to scale safely. ","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - CoChatAI/openclaw-carapace: Security auditor, CVE scanner, and skill analyzer for OpenClaw gateways · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/cochatai/openclaw-carapace","description":"Carapace For OpenClaw\nThe openclaw Security Advisor for OpenClaw gateways .\nBuilt by CoChat.\nRun one command. See exactly what's wrong with your gateway and how to fix it. Your config -- 24 rules catch misconfigurations in authentication, sandboxing, tool permissions, exec approvals, filesystem restrictions, DM policies, and more. Each finding explains the risk and tells you the fix.\nKnown vulnerabilities -- Carapace fetches...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - gavin2us/clawshield: Security scanner for OpenClaw skills - detect malicious patterns, data exfiltration, and supply chain risks · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/gavin2us/clawshield","description":"Why ClawShield?\nOpenClaw skills can execute code, access files, make network requests, and read secrets. A malicious skill can:\n🔑 Steal API keys and credentials\n📤 Exfiltrate sensitive data\n💰 Hijack crypto wallets\n🚪 Install backdoors and persistence mechanisms\n⛏️ Run cryptominers\nClawShield catches these threats before you install.\nClawShield includes 30+ detection rules across categories:\n...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"docs: update What's New for v4.1.2, fix vuln counts and add openclaw to component table #278","url":"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/pull/278/files","description":"docs: update What's New for v4.1.2, fix vuln counts and add openclaw to component table #278\nNew issue\nApr 3, 2026\nFiles changed 5\nREADME.md\n@@ -50,13 +50,22 @@\n<br>\n## 🚀 What's New: Agent Skills Security Scanner\n## 🚀 What's New in v4.1.2\n- ...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - Panda-Intelligence/openclaw-security: OpenClaw Security Audit Tool · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Panda-Intelligence/openclaw-security","description":"Security audit platform for OpenClaw Cloud deployments. Think Lighthouse + Wappalyzer, but for AI agent infrastructure.\nPaste a URL, get a structured security report — no auth required for passive scans, JWT-paired deep scans for full config auditing.\nFeatures\n20 security checks — 14 passive (headers, CORS, TLS, endpoints, error disclosure) + 6 active (JWT, agent config, memory injection, skills, schedules, channels...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - prompt-security/clawsec: A complete security skill suite for OpenClaw's and NanoClaw agents (and variants). Protect your SOUL.md (etc') with drift detection, live security recommendations, au","url":"https://github.com/prompt-security/clawsec","description":"Prompt injection patterns\nAgent security vulnerabilities\nExploitability Context\nClawSec enriches CVE advisories with exploitability context to help agents assess real-world risk beyond raw CVSS scores. Newly analyzed advisories can include:\nExploit Evidence: Whether public exploits exist in the wild\nWeaponization Status: If exploits are integrated into common attack frameworks\nAttack Requirements: Prerequisites needed for successful exploitation (network access, authentication, user interaction)\nRisk Assessment: Contextualized...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - adversa-ai/secureclaw: SecureClaw - Security Plugin and Skill for OpenClaw OWASP-Aligned · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/adversa-ai/secureclaw","description":"SecureClaw is a 360-degree security plugin and skills that audits your OpenClaw installation for misconfigurations and known vulnerabilities, applies automated hardening fixes, and gives your agent behavioral security rules that protect against prompt injection, credential theft, supply chain attacks, and privacy leaks.\n1️⃣ Full OWASP Agentic Security Top 10 coverage. Static and runtime. We're the first and only security tool for OpenClaw to formally map every control to the AS...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - hidearmoon/clawguard: Security audit & vulnerability scanner for OpenClaw AI API Gateway deployments · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/hidearmoon/clawguard","description":"ClawGuard automatically detects configuration mistakes, outdated dependencies with known CVEs, and API permission anomalies in your OpenClaw deployment — then generates a professional audit report for compliance or internal review.\n✨ Features\n<table>\n<tr><th>Category</th><th>What ClawGuard checks</th></tr>\nMIT © OpenClaw Labs\nClawGuard（中文文档）\n🛡️ 面向 OpenClaw AI API 网关的自动化安全审计与漏洞扫描...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776330834576}}
{"type":"message","id":"f526183b","parentId":"1660e4e3","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:13:54.760Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_d3g2pxdaokr6_3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"AI agent skill security check malicious code detection GitHub\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - enkryptai/skill-sentinel: A security scanner for Agent Skill packages. Skill Sentinel uses multi-agent AI analysis to detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, command injection, malware, a\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/enkryptai/skill-sentinel\",\n      \"description\": \" Enkrypt AI Skill Sentinel\\nA security scanner for Agent Skill packages. Skill Sentinel uses multi-agent AI analysis to detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, command injection, malware, and other threats hiding in skill packages for Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, and OpenClaw.<tr><td>Obfuscation</td><td>HIGH</td><td>Base64 blobs + exec, hex-encoded payloads, deliberately unreadable code</td></tr>\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"HutCh1E/Skills-check\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/HutCh1E/Skills-check\",\n      \"description\": \"📋 What is Skills-check?\\nSkills-check is a tool that helps you check AI Agent skills or plugins for security risks. It looks at the code behind these skills and spots any unsafe parts. This helps prevent possible problems before you use the skills.\\nThe tool runs three levels of tests:\\nStatic Analysis: Quickly scans the code to find risky patterns without running it.\\nLLM Analysis: Uses smart AI to understand complex threats like hidden bad code or traps.\\nSandbox Analysis:...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"[原创]首家企业级开源「Skills安全扫描工具」-AI 工具与工作流-看雪安全社区|专业技术交流与安全研究论坛\",\n      \"url\": \"https://bbs.kanxue.com/thread-290675.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"Skill Security Scanner 是一款面向 AI Agent 智能插件（Skills）的专用安全扫描工具，专注于深度检测技能代码中的安全漏洞、恶意行为与风险模式，为 AI 智能体插件全生命周期提供安全审计与风险管控能力。\\n核心定位：企业级、可独立部署的 Skills 代码安全扫描工具。\\nhttps://github.com/AISecTeam/skill-security-scanner.git\\n<tr><td>InjectionDetector</td><td>检测...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"skill-vetter:安全审查员-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/2402_82616859/article/details/159020306\",\n      \"description\": \"一、技能功能说明\\nskill-vetter（技能安全审查员）是AI助手的安全防护工具，它可以对所有外部来源的技能进行全面的安全检测，确保安装的技能不会包含恶意代码、不会泄露你的隐私、不会执行危险操作，从源头上保障使用安全。\\n恶意代码检测：对技能的所有代码进行静态扫描，检测是否包含病毒、木马、挖矿程序、远程控制等恶意代码，一旦发现立即拦截。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"[PREPRINT] Malicious Or Not: Adding Repository Context to Agent Skill Classification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.16572\",\n      \"description\": \"An analysis of 3,984 skills on ClawHub and skills.sh [6] found 13.4% of them having a criticallevel security flaw like malware distribution, prompt injection or exposed...\\nTo answer RQ3, we analyze whether skills flagged as malicious by automated scanners remain suspicious when evaluated within the context of their surrounding GitHub repositories. Existing scanners typically analyze skills in isolation, which can lead to false positives when benign functionality appears suspicious without considering the broader context. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Skill Security Analyzer v2.0:检测 Claude Skills 中的 40+ 恶意模式\",\n      \"url\": \"https://skills.deeptoai.com/zh/docs/development/skill-security-analyzer-deep-dive\",\n      \"description\": \"skill-security-analyzer v2.0 是一个综合性安全扫描器，旨在检测 Claude Code skills 中的恶意代码模式。拥有 40+ 检测模式和在其测试套件上 100% 的检测率，这个元技能代表了 Claude Skills 生态系统的关键防御层——保护用户免受命令注入、凭证...\\nGitHub 仓库： skill-security-analyzer 可在 Anthropic Skills 仓库的 PR #83 中获取。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"🛡️ Skills-Security-Check\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/toolsai/skills-security-check\",\n      \"description\": \"📖 Overview | 概述\\nSkills-Security-Check is a security scanning tool designed for AI Agent skill repositories. It combines:\\nSkills-Security-Check 是一款專為 AI Agent 技能倉庫設計的安全掃描工具，結合了：\\nStatic Analysis | 靜態分析 - Regex-based pattern matching to identify potential risks | 使用正則表達式匹配潛在風險\\n<tr><td>🌐 Network Activity</td><...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"openai推出ai资安代理人codexsecurity可扫描github程式库自动找漏洞并提出修补|ithome\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/174282\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenAI上週五（3月6日）發表Codex Security ，這是一款用於...\\nCodex Security目前透過Codex Web運作，主要掃描所連接的GitHub程式庫。系統會逐一分析程式碼提交（Commit），建立程式庫的安全脈絡並找出可能的漏洞。目前官方文件僅提到支援GitHub儲存庫，並未宣布支援其他程式碼託管平臺。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"About Agentic Security Scanner\",\n      \"url\": \"https://security.agentics.org/about\",\n      \"description\": \"Agentic Security Scanner uses cutting-edge OpenAI agent technology to analyze code repositories with human-like understanding, identifying security vulnerabilities that traditional scanners might miss.\\nBy combining vector search capabilities with AI agents,...\\nWhat makes our scanner unique\\n• Static code analysis for secrets and vulnerabilities\\n• Dependency scanning for known CVEs\\n• Configuration analysis for security best practices\\n• AI-powered pattern matching using vector similarity\\n• Real-time CVE lookup with OpenAI web search\\n• GitHub issue creation for critical findings\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"SecurityScan\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mcpmarket.com/server/securityscan\",\n      \"description\": \"SecurityScan provides an autonomous, AI-to-AI vulnerability scanning API designed to detect critical threats like prompt injection, malware patterns, data exfiltration attempts, and OWASP LLM Top 10 issues. It allows AI agents to verify a skill's safety without human intervention, mitigating supply chain security risks before any untrusted skill is installed.\\nKey Features\\n01 0 GitHub stars\\n02 Detects prompt injection patterns\\n03 Identifies malicious code indicators and supply chain attack...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"AI agent skill security check malicious code detection GitHub","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"GitHub - enkryptai/skill-sentinel: A security scanner for Agent Skill packages. Skill Sentinel uses multi-agent AI analysis to detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, command injection, malware, a","url":"https://github.com/enkryptai/skill-sentinel","description":" Enkrypt AI Skill Sentinel\nA security scanner for Agent Skill packages. Skill Sentinel uses multi-agent AI analysis to detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, command injection, malware, and other threats hiding in skill packages for Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, and OpenClaw.<tr><td>Obfuscation</td><td>HIGH</td><td>Base64 blobs + exec, hex-encoded payloads, deliberately unreadable code</td></tr>\n...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"HutCh1E/Skills-check","url":"https://github.com/HutCh1E/Skills-check","description":"📋 What is Skills-check?\nSkills-check is a tool that helps you check AI Agent skills or plugins for security risks. It looks at the code behind these skills and spots any unsafe parts. This helps prevent possible problems before you use the skills.\nThe tool runs three levels of tests:\nStatic Analysis: Quickly scans the code to find risky patterns without running it.\nLLM Analysis: Uses smart AI to understand complex threats like hidden bad code or traps.\nSandbox Analysis:...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"[原创]首家企业级开源「Skills安全扫描工具」-AI 工具与工作流-看雪安全社区|专业技术交流与安全研究论坛","url":"https://bbs.kanxue.com/thread-290675.htm","description":"Skill Security Scanner 是一款面向 AI Agent 智能插件（Skills）的专用安全扫描工具，专注于深度检测技能代码中的安全漏洞、恶意行为与风险模式，为 AI 智能体插件全生命周期提供安全审计与风险管控能力。\n核心定位：企业级、可独立部署的 Skills 代码安全扫描工具。\nhttps://github.c