{"type":"message","id":"c90362be","parentId":"20191bdf","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:14:04.805Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ryribe6loeyn_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"clawhub.ai top rated skills price intelligence procurement 2026\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw热门技能深度分析:数据驱动的生态全景与变现指南OpenClaw热门技能深度分析:数据驱动的生态全景与变现 - 掘金\",\n      \"url\": \"https://juejin.cn/post/7615966482812289033\",\n      \"description\": \"数据声明：本报告基于2026年3月最新数据，涵盖Open...\\n数据来源包括ClawHub官方统计数据、51CTO《OpenClaw技能商店Top10爆款推荐》、头条《OpenClaw宝典》、清新研究《OpenClaw发展研究2.0报告》及工信部安全预警报告，经过交叉验证确保准确性。\\n高潜力技能：Skill Vetter、OpenClaw Security Monitor、N8n Workflow Automation\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw E-commerce for Openclaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.toolify.ai/openclaw-skills/openclaw-ecommerce-5644\",\n      \"description\": \"The OpenClaw E-commerce skill is a robust, local-first toolkit designed for Openclaw Skills users who need to automate commerce-related workflows. It empowers AI agents to monitor product...\\nMonitor competitor pricing trends to maintain market competitiveness.\\\\n- Track cost-of-goods-sold (COGS) for dropshipping and print-on-demand businesses.\\\\n- Calculate precise break-even points by accounting for platform fees and shipping costs.\\\\n- Automate alerts for price drops on raw materials or inventory supplies.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"ClawHub Top Skills 2026: Most Popular OpenClaw ClawHub Skills List\",\n      \"url\": \"https://clawoneclick.com/en/blog/clawhub-top-skills-2026\",\n      \"description\": \"Product Updates\\nClawHub Top Skills 2026: Most Popular OpenClaw ClawHub Skills List\\nClawOneClick Team\\nMarch 14, 2026\\nTL;DR — Quick Answer\\nClawHub top skills 2026: 3,286 skills with 1.5M+ total downloads. The ClawHub most popular skills by