ighlighted for quick trust.\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"clawhub.ai top rated skills price intelligence procurement 2026","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"OpenClaw热门技能深度分析:数据驱动的生态全景与变现指南OpenClaw热门技能深度分析:数据驱动的生态全景与变现 - 掘金","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7615966482812289033","description":"数据声明：本报告基于2026年3月最新数据，涵盖Open...\n数据来源包括ClawHub官方统计数据、51CTO《OpenClaw技能商店Top10爆款推荐》、头条《OpenClaw宝典》、清新研究《OpenClaw发展研究2.0报告》及工信部安全预警报告，经过交叉验证确保准确性。\n高潜力技能：Skill Vetter、OpenClaw Security Monitor、N8n Workflow Automation\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw E-commerce for Openclaw","url":"https://www.toolify.ai/openclaw-skills/openclaw-ecommerce-5644","description":"The OpenClaw E-commerce skill is a robust, local-first toolkit designed for Openclaw Skills users who need to automate commerce-related workflows. It empowers AI agents to monitor product...\nMonitor competitor pricing trends to maintain market competitiveness.\\n- Track cost-of-goods-sold (COGS) for dropshipping and print-on-demand businesses.\\n- Calculate precise break-even points by accounting for platform fees and shipping costs.\\n- Automate alerts for price drops on raw materials or inventory supplies.","siteName":""},{"title":"ClawHub Top Skills 2026: Most Popular OpenClaw ClawHub Skills List","url":"https://clawoneclick.com/en/blog/clawhub-top-skills-2026","description":"Product Updates\nClawHub Top Skills 2026: Most Popular OpenClaw ClawHub Skills List\nClawOneClick Team\nMarch 14, 2026\nTL;DR — Quick Answer\nClawHub top skills 2026: 3,286 skills with 1.5M+ total downloads. The ClawHub most popular skills by installs: Capability Evolver (35K), Wacli...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw Hub: Discover 3,286+ ClawHub Skills for AI Agents","url":"https://openclaw-hub.org","description":" and safely use Claw...\nCapability Evolver\nAI/ML\nAI self-evolution engine for OpenClaw agents. Enhances agent capabilities through continuous learning.\nAI/ML Skills\n1,588 AI and machine learning skills for OpenClaw agents\nYes, ClawHub is completely free and open source. All 3,286+ skills on the ClawHub platform are freely accessible. OpenClaw Hub provides information about these free skills at no cost.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw Skills for Marketing: 15 Must-Have Tools for 2026","url":"https://clawoneclick.com/en/blog/openclaw-skills-marketing-guide","description":"With 3,286 skills available on ClawHub after the February 2026 security cleanup, marketers can automate keyword research, content creation, rank tracking, and campaign management without switching between expensive tools.\n3. Rank Tracker - Position Monitoring\nWhat it does: Monitors your keyword rankings over time...\nWhat it does: A framework that lets your agent learn from interactions and optimize responses over time. The highest-rated skill on ClawHub with 132 stars.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Best ClawHub Skills: A Complete Guide","url":"https://www.datacamp.com/blog/best-clawhub-skills","description":"Common Mistakes When Using ClawHub Skills\nConclusion\nFAQs\nClawHub (clawhub.ai) is the skill registry for OpenClaw, and the number of skills there has grown faster than most people expected. As of early 2026, the registry...\nClawHub is the skill marketplace for OpenClaw. Think of it as npm for AI agents. Anyone with a GitHub account at least a week old can publish skills. Anyone can install them. ","siteName":""},{"title":"feat: per-skill cost attribution (ClawHub)","url":"https://github.com/vivekchand/clawmetry/pull/311","description":"feat : per - skill cost attribution ( claw hub ) # 311 vivek chand wants to merge 4 commits into main feat / skill - cost - attribution vivek chand mar 23 , 2026 ...","siteName":""},{"title":"ClawHub","url":"https://clawhub.com","description":"ClawHub, the skill dock for sharp agents.\nUpload AgentSkills bundles, version them like npm, and make them searchable with vectors. No gatekeeping, just signal.\nSearch skills