{"type":"message","id":"adab67d0","parentId":"641b5031","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:14:25.023Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! I found a lot of very relevant security scanning skills. Let me now also search for the top price intelligence/procurement skills specifically for v2.0 reference.\n\nKey findings:\n1. **Security Scanner TOP PICKS:**\n   - **Claw Security Scanner** (clawhub.ai/BetsyMalthus/claw-security-scanner) - MIT-0, detects malicious code, credential leaks, dependency vulnerabilities\n   - **Skill Scanner** (clawhub.ai/Trypto1019/arc-skill-scanner) - MIT-0, specifically for OpenClaw skills, found 341 malicious skills on ClawHub\n   - **Agent Audit Scanner** (clawhub.ai/HeadyZhang/agent-audit-scanner)\n   - **OpenA2A Security** (clawhub.ai/abdelsfane/opena2a-security) - CVE-2026-25253 detection\n   - **ClawShield** (GitHub: gavin2us/clawshield) - 30+ detection rules\n   - **SecureClaw** (GitHub: adversa-ai/secureclaw) - OWASP Aligned, full security plugin\n   - **Skill Sentinel** (GitHub: enkryptai/skill-sentinel) - Multi-agent AI analysis\n   - **ClawGuard** (GitHub: hidearmoon/clawguard) - Config audit + CVE scan\n   - **OpenClaw Security** (GitHub: Panda-Intelligence/openclaw-security) - 20 security checks\n\n2. **Price Intelligence (for v2.0 reference):**\n   - **Price Tracker** on ClawHub\n   - **OpenClaw E-commerce** - monitors competitor pricing, tracks COGS, calculates break-even\n\nNow let me summarize for the user with the TOP recommendations."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**🔒 安全检测SKILL TOP推荐 + 价格情报SKILL TOP推荐**\n\n---\n\n## 一、SKILL安全检测 TOP 2（必须先装！）\n\n| 排名 | Skill | 特点 | 来源 |\n|------|-------|------|------|\n| 🥇 | **Claw Security Scanner** | 恶意代码+凭据泄露+依赖漏洞 | ClawHub官方 ✅ |\n| 🥈 | **Skill Scanner** | 已检测出341个恶意SKILL | ClawHub官方 ✅ |\n\n**安装命令：**\n```bash\nnpx clawhub@latest install BetsyMalthus/claw-security-scanner\nnpx clawhub@latest install Trypto1019/arc-skill-scanner\n```\n\n---\n\n## 二、价格情报 TOP 2（等安全SKILL部署完再装）\n\n| 排名 | Skill | 特点 | 来源 |\n|------|-------|------|------|\n| 🥇 | **Price Tracker** | 跨平台比价+利润计算+套利识别 | ClawHub ⭐ |\n| 🥈 | **OpenClaw E-commerce** | 竞品监控+COGS追踪+盈亏平衡 | ClawHub ⭐ |\n\n---\n\n## 三、其他门类TOP推荐（暂缓，逐步添加）\n\n| 门类 | TOP 1 | TOP 2 |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| 营销 | Rank Tracker | Capability Evolver |\n| 安全 | Claw Security Scanner | SecureClaw (OWASP) |\n| 自动化 | N8n Workflow Automation | - |\n\n---\n\n## 四、关键发现 ⚠️\n\n> **RankClaw审计结果**：ClawHub上有 **1,103个恶意SKILL（7.5%）**，自动扫描会漏掉！\n\n**必须先装安全检测SKILL，再装任何其他SKILL！**\n\n---\n\n**要不要我现在用clawhub安装这两个安全检测SKILL？** 🔒🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776330845190,"responseId":"062fdb5d5a424e081eb4efffc15bde6b"}}
