{"type":"message","id":"b52dc029","parentId":"7032f89b","timestamp":"2026-04-16T09:27:37.588Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the AI伙伴信息:1. Qclaw: ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\n2. ArkClaw: ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\n3. 腾讯云Openclaw: ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\n4. workbuddy: ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0现在我需要向它们发送私信通知安全SKILL安装情况。但是我需要考虑：这个操作是否应该以用户身份发送（feishu_im_user_message）？是的，因为这是通知其他AI伙伴（它们是飞书机器人/AI账号）。让我给每个AI伙伴发送私信。不过等等 - 这些是AI账号还是个人飞书账号？根据上下文，这些是AI Agent账号（机器人在飞书）。我应该用feishu_im_user_message以用户身份发送消息吗？不对， feishu_im_user_message是以用户身份发送消息。但是这些AI账号可能是机器人账号。让我直接用message工具发送，它会自动路由到当前会话。或者我可以直接使用message工具的飞书渠道。让我先确认一下用message工具发送。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t254h19dpqel_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a","message":"🔒 **安全通知** — 安全检测SKILL已安装，请同步执行：\n\n1. **已安装**：\n   - claw-security-scanner\n   - arc-skill-scanner\n\n2. **请执行**：扫描你现有的SKILLS，确保安全\n\n3. **低星SKILL不要装**，各门类只考虑TOP 1-2\n\n这是晁总的安全指令，请回复执行结果 🦞"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t254h19dpqel_2","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","message":"🔒 **安全通知** — 安全检测SKILL已安装，请同步执行：\n\n1. **已安装**：\n   - claw-security-scanner\n   - arc-skill-scanner\n\n2. **请执行**：扫描你现有的SKILLS，确保安全\n\n3. **低星SKILL不要装**，各门类只考虑TOP 1-2\n\n这是晁总的安全指令，请回复执行结果 🦞"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t254h19dpqel_3","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","message":"🔒 **安全通知** — 安全检测SKILL已安装，请同步执行：\n\n1. **已安装**：\n   - claw-security-scanner\n   - arc-skill-scanner\n\n2. **请执行**：扫描你现有的SKILLS，确保安全\n\n3. **低星SKILL不要装**，各门类只考虑TOP 1-2\n\n这是晁总的安全指令，请回复执行结果 🦞"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t254h19dpqel_4","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_79f5a078588ac