CP Server (Python)\n    ↓\nOpenClaw MCP 集成\n    ↓\n自然语言查询京东商品/价格\n```\n\n**优势**：一次开发，多个 AI Agent 都能用\n\n---\n\n**方案二：参考 1688 SKILL 开发 Python 脚本**\n\n你之前部署的 `jd-taobao-api-guide` SKILL 可以参考。1688 SKILL 里已经有：\n- ✅ API 申请流程文档\n- ✅ Python 调用示例\n- ✅ 签名生成代码\n\n**京东 API 调用流程类似**，可以复用这套框架。\n\n---\n\n**京东开放平台需要申请**：\n\n| 项目 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台 | https://open.jd.com |\n| 认证 | 企业/个人开发者 |\n| API Key | appkey + appsecret |\n| 审核 | 自研应用免审核 |\n\n---\n\n**要不要我把 1688 SKILL 里的调用框架复制一份，帮...\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n<think>\nThe user is asking me to summarize a conversation between a user and an AI assistant. Let me analyze the conversation:\n\n1. The conversation is in Chinese (Simplified)\n2. The user (晁留柱) is replying to a message about 1688 API application\n3. The user says \"确认1688也只能是企业才能申请\" (Confirming that 1688 can only be applied by enterprises)\n4. The assistant did a web search to verify this claim\n5. The search results show mixed information - some sources say personal developers can apply for basic permissions, but enterprise certification (business license) is required for core APIs\n\nLet me structure this according to the required format:\n\nThe conversation is short - it's essentially the user correcting a previous message that said individuals could apply for 1688 API, and the assistant verifying this through web search.\n\nKey points:\n- User: 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\n- The user is confirming that 1688 API requires enterprise/business registration, not personal\n- The assistant searched and found that:\n  - Basic data APIs can be accessed with personal real-name authentication\n  - Core/business APIs require business license + corporate account verification\n  - This aligns with what the user said\n\nLet me create the summary with the exact format requested. Note that the user wants:\n## Decisions\n## Open TODOs\n## Constraints/Rules\n## Pending user asks\n## Exact identifiers\n\nThis is different from the initial format I thought about. Let me reformat.\n</think>\n\n## Decisions\n- **1688 API 确实需要企业资质**: 根据搜索结果确认，1688开放平台核心API需要企业认证（营业执照+对公账户），个人开发者权限受限。基础数据接口可使用个人实名认证，但功能有限。\n\n## Open TODOs\n- 需要为晁总寻找适合个人用户的API解决方案（排除1688和企业版京东）\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- 用户要求确认1688 API申请门槛\n- 用户可能没有企业资质（仅持有个人支付宝）\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户可能在寻求其他可用的电商API方案\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- 用户ID: `ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409`\n- 用户名: `晁留柱`\n- 消息ID: `om_x100b513db8949088c3c2e7ca35d8f17`\n- 回复消息ID: `om_x100b513dd55560e8c38b93e5b300f54`\n- 1688开放平台: `https://open.1688.com`\n- 时间戳: `Thu 2026-04-16 08:35 UTC`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Pre-compaction memory flush. Store durable memories only in memory/2026-04-16.md (create memory/ if needed). Treat workspace bootstrap/reference files such as MEMORY.md, DREAMS.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, and AGENTS.md as read-only during this flush; never overwrite, replace, or edit them. If memory/2026-04-16.md already exists, APPEND new content only and do not overwrite existing entries. Do NOT create timestamped variant files (e.g., 2026-04-16-HHMM.md); always use the canonical 2026-04-16.md filename. If nothing to store, reply with NO_REPLY.\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 16th, 2026 - 8:11 AM (...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (write): Appended content to memory/2026-04-16.md.\n- Assistant: HEARTBEAT_OK\n[non-text content: thinking]\n- User: System: [2026-04-16 08:11:02 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b513dd798a4a0c31ca7a2ebc67c0]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b513dd798a4a0c31ca7a2ebc67c0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 08:11 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n既然