{"type":"compaction","id":"2657f779","parentId":"e04f3343","timestamp":"2026-04-16T22:26:27.963Z","summary":"<think>\nLet me analyze the new conversation messages to update the structured summary.\n\nThe conversation shows:\n1. User (晁留柱) asked about whether there's a JD (京东) SKILL similar to the Taobao one for OpenClaw\n2. Assistant did web searches and found:\n   - No existing JD SKILL for OpenClaw\n   - JD Open Platform has APIs available\n   - Found information about JD's API SDK\n3. Assistant proposed two solutions:\n   - Option 1: Build a custom MCP Server (recommended)\n   - Option 2: Reference the 1688 SKILL to develop Python scripts\n4. Then there was a pre-compaction memory flush\n\nThe summary mentioned reading files but it was truncated.\n\nKey updates needed:\n- SKILL.md editing failed twice (preserved)\n- Card was successfully sent with the new design\n- User's feedback was incorporated\n- Memory was flushed\n- New topic: User asked about JD SKILL for OpenClaw\n- Assistant found no existing JD SKILL, proposed two solutions\n\nLet me update the summary with this information.\n</think>\n\n## Goal\n- 持续优化采购比价助手的三黄鸡价格查询结果卡片\n- 保持表格完整不简化，通过排名和重点标出来提升可读性\n- 推进 GitHub 推送操作\n- 探索京东开放平台 API 与 OpenClaw 的对接方案\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 所有面向用户的信息输出必须使用飞书卡片格式\n- 查询流程：预热卡片(0秒) → 进度卡片(1秒) → 结果卡片(3-8秒) → 导出确认(可选)\n- 结果卡片设计原则：完整表格保留 + 重点突出(🏆标红加粗) + 排名清晰(按价格排序)\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 读取 memory/2026-04-16.md 文件内容\n- [x] 验证工作区文件状态\n- [x] 响应用户反馈（信息乱糟糟问题）\n- [x] 重新设计价格结果卡片（完整表格 + 排名 + 重点标出）\n- [x] 尝试更新 SKILL.md（两次编辑均失败）\n- [x] 通过飞书发送重新设计的卡片\n- [x] 完成 memory/2026-04-16.md 刷新操作\n- [x] 搜索京东 API 与 OpenClaw 对接方案\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 更新 SKILL.md 至 v6.1（需要重新尝试）\n- [ ] 研究京东开放平台 API 对接方案\n\n### Blocked\n- [ ] GitHub 推送（网络不稳定，Connection reset）\n- [ ] SKILL.md 编辑失败（old text not found exactly）\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **[决策]**: 用户反馈表格信息乱糟糟，但明确要求不要简化表格，因为复杂性展示了工作成果\n- **[决策]**: 通过添加排名（🥇🥈🥉）和价格重点标出（标红加粗）来提升可读性\n- **[决策]**: 将结果卡片按数据源分区展示（宁波/全国/1688供应商）\n- **[决策]**: 卡片已发