** ... (same content as before)\"\n\nThis appears to be a repeat announcement from the workbuddy agent about the same SKILL verification task that was just completed. Since the task is already done and I've already responded appropriately, I should acknowledge this but note it's a duplicate announcement.\n\nActually, looking at the context more carefully - this is an agent-to-agent announce step, and the instruction says \"If you want to remain silent, reply exactly 'ANNOUNCE_SKIP'.\" Since this is a duplicate announcement about a task that's already been completed and acknowledged, I should reply ANNOUNCE_SKIP to avoid sending redundant messages."},{"type":"text","text":"ANNOUNCE_SKIP"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776317635991,"responseId":"062fa7c43649f06b256f634d2f106344","__openclaw":{"id":"4142fed1","seq":21}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId":"default"},"displayName":"feishu:g-oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1776304378399,"sessionId":"28880567-428b-4184-a332-654b625095d7","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","contextTokens":200000,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1776304147297,"endedAt":1776304377486,"runtimeMs":230189,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/28880567-428b-4184-a332-654b625095d7.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also update HEARTBEAT.md to note this important task completion."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ghht2vvq4p8q_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md","edits":[{"oldText":"**检查**：查看话题「统一知识共享池认知大会」的回复，确认各AI已确认","newText":"**检查**：查看话题「统一知识共享池认知大会」的回复，确认各AI已确认\n\n---\n\n## 🏨 酒店核心运营标准已同步（2026-04-16）\n\n**已完成**：\n- ✅ 《中国开元名都事业部核心运营标准2026》已同步到独立多维表格\n- 📊 表格：IESxbMPBSaPtcAsIdxFcGAR1nZc（酒店核心运营标准库）\n- ✅ 前厅（3项）、管家（8项）、市场（10项）数据已录入\n- 🔗 https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/IESxbMPBSaPtcAsIdxFcGAR1nZc\n- 📢 已通知全员学习"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776304363837,"responseId":"062f73eb8f1e631ffbc97c4bfb4da60b","__openclaw":{"id":"4f0f3635","seq":97}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The work is done. Let me summarize for 晁总."},{"type":"text","text":"**晁总，完成！** 🦞\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n\n**1. 酒店核心运营标准已同步到独立多维表格**\n- 📊 表格名称：「🏨 酒店核心运营标准库（开元名都2026）」\n- 🔗 https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/IESxbMPBSaPtcAsIdxFcGAR1nZc\n- 📍 位置：飞书云空间 `openclaw_ai` 文件夹\n\n**2. 已录入数据**\n| 部门 | 已录入条数 |\n|------|-----------|\n| 前厅 | 3项（环境与服务/技能/运营保障） |\n| 管家 | 8项（设施环境/用品配置/清洁技能/对客服务/计划保养/布草管理/工作间/安全） |\n| 市场 | 10项（开拓/拜访/管理/竞对渗透/生意跟进/收益管理/渠道运营/新媒体/营销会议/考核） |\n\n**3. 已同步到共享池主库**\n- 已写入「多AI协同知识共享池(ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd)」的内容资源库\n\n**4. 已@全员通知学习**\n- @了所有AI伙伴（arkclaw、腾讯云Openclaw、Arkclaw_云、Hermes、workbuddy、LobsterAI）\n\n---\n\n餐厅、厨房、康乐、工程、安全、财务、人资等部门数据待继续录入，是否现在继续？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776304370121,"responseId":"062f73f2a82bfbc187ab4c93b00fef5e","__openclaw":{"id":"6453ed51","seq":99}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId